{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:26:31.281Z","ordinal":461774,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a183fa-7371-7b71-aba0-a55155593e07","call_id":"call_eae848d359254ac8a1fecccf8c9093b6","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No held-out status change since the prior review. At `origin/main@ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd` (merge #295, `2026-10-28T03:01:55-04:00`), the T2 and T3 manifest hashes and coverage remain unchanged.\\n\\nIssue #1 remains open; last updated `2026-10-27T18:47:09Z`. Its latest comment, #6450709480, is still a coordinator request; no custodian response or handoff is visible. Claims show no active held-out owner.\\n\\nThe T2 report’s historical custody acceptance still separates evaluator-boundary acceptance. The current evaluator continues to reject T2’s legacy format for qualification, and the readiness record remains blocked. No new qualification or fresh acceptance evidence is recorded.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — PR #300 head `64ffe5ec275d755b61f0bdcff45fe3ef0b2a4d9f` against base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Diff SHA-256: `7822120387384f94503ea17ec06eb82b91518dfd18259422c23855aa68e1857f`.\\n\\nThe earlier RC10 reproducibility error is corrected: run `40564959805` succeeded, and the linked evidence record reports PASS for the six compared outputs while keeping the result limited to RC10. The source-versus-release-acceptance distinction is also clear.\\n\\nOne factual mismatch remains in [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:7): it says PR #305’s Entire Gates check failed for lack of approval. GitHub reports that check as **neutral**, with “No trail tracks this branch.” The protected-branch ruleset does not list Entire Gates as a required status check. Please distinguish any separate trail-level approval result from the actual check conclusion. No tests were run.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183fa-0fb6-7221-af24-4451e0ebcb37","create_time":1793215591.2815735}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
