{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:35:35.246Z","ordinal":462101,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18402-c04e-7801-8a4f-d0b0b04780b3","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — PR #308 exact head `aa86c943f9f2326912c12f87b9a2bece65feb914` against base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. The unified patch SHA-256 is `9b8e1e2723b9168e5cfd7c34fce4cd05e7dbe84bf6c25e29c97e9b673d297ca1`, matching the requested hash.\n\nThe changed files are limited to `checkpoint.ts` and its two restore tests. The ignore check invokes Git with an argument array, `--no-index`, and a `./`-anchored escaped path; failures other than “not ignored” fail closed at the restore preflight ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:44), [checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:169)). Tests cover pathspec-looking filenames, ignored descendants, and preserving the index and workspace on rejected restores ([checkpoint_restore.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts:151), [checkpoint_restore.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts:1931)).\n\nRestore validates write/removal targets before changing the index, limits index updates to a nested workspace when applicable, and checks nested-repository and ignored-path obstructions before mutation ([checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:200), [checkpoint.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/checkpoint.ts:1271)). I reviewed source and tests without running them; hosted CI remains separate evidence. No actionable finding in this review. I kept the disposition tied to the exact revision and did not treat it as release qualification. citeMEMORY.md:777-779"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a183fa-0fb6-7221-af24-4451e0ebcb37","create_time":1793216135.2464905}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22015}}
