{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:38:04.549Z","ordinal":462161,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a183fa-0fb6-7221-af24-4451e0ebcb37","turn_id":"01a183fa-0fb6-7221-af24-4451e0ebcb37","last_agent_message":"**The lack of a second human reviewer is not blocking PR #308.** The repository ruleset requires zero approving reviews, and an independent agent accepted the exact rebased patch. I’m recording that as agent review, not human approval.\n\nPR #308 is now rebased on `main` at `13e45a0` and pushed as `aa86c943`. Requirements enforcement passed on that head: 123 rows, with 12 qualification deferrals still explicit. CodeQL and JS/TS checks passed; the Node 22/24 suites are running, and Linux packaging will follow.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. The PR is not merged, and this work does not satisfy the held-out, provider, terminal, cross-runner, or exact-RC release gates.","started_at":1793215565,"completed_at":1793216284,"duration_ms":718749,"time_to_first_token_ms":6653}}
