{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:41:47.000Z","ordinal":462271,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-efdc2970-b658-4ee2-aaf1-0a89b861a143","process_id":"57468","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short --branch && sed -n '1,20p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md && gh pr view 305 --json statusCheckRollup --jq '.statusCheckRollup[]|select(.name|test(\"Entire\"))|{name,conclusion,state,detailsUrl}' && gh pr view 300 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short --branch && sed -n '1,20p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md && gh pr view 305 --json statusCheckRollup --jq '.statusCheckRollup[]|select(.name|test(\"Entire\"))|{name,conclusion,state,detailsUrl}' && gh pr view 300 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"## v1/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:15 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) is still running its Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. No post-merge CI conclusion is available yet. The last completed exact-main run is CI [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) and CodeQL [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) on prior main `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; those passed source CI, Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke, version synchronization, and the requirements checker. On that prior revision, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #305 changed operation restart behavior and tests, not requirement rows; the current-main run must still finish before claiming its exact-source gates passed. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check failed only because the review trail lacked approval; that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it at `41a63b4cfbd8c2ec40f384de28db4bea0faee49a` on base `8580c821`. At this observation, PR #308 Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed; Linux and Entire Gates were still running. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on base `8580c821`; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while Node 22/24 and Entire Gates were still running. PR #300's prior head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb763b3ecfac38f2e675` had Node 22/24 in progress and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed; this readiness correction merges current main and requires fresh exact-head checks. Source PR checks are separate from release qualification.\n\n**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) completed successfully (all jobs passed) for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence artifact reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for the six compared outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The current requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; ledger disposition remains for its owner to reconcile. RC10 evidence applies only to RC10 and does not establish cross-runner qualification for a successor RC. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned; its latest custodian status request is unanswered as of 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC. Held-out custody acceptance and T2/T3/T4 qualification therefore remain unverified. The manual terminal matrix remains 0/15; no genuine operator cell results are recorded. Remaining standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, human terminal, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n\n**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n\nThe checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence; their source revision, PR, CI, and qualification statements are superseded by this observation.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 16:25 UTC; superseded)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`. Exact-head CI run [40720824591](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824591) passed the Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; the Linux packaging/reproducibility job was still running at observation time. CodeQL run [40720824319](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824319) passed. The CI jobs completed `sync-version --check` and the requirements checker successfully on this source. These results qualify the source revision only; they do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n**Release PRs:** PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) is merged at `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`, included in current main. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) is based on `145d464` at exact head `49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c`; its latest follow-up scopes checkout to the nested workspace and extends the regression to preserve both staged and unstaged sibling state. The prior nested-index delta at `662d084` was independently ACCEPTed (SHA-256 `61f4e40bc135152ffa003c82bdc31fc15703542b5bd9ba3b67f7b6b1edae1cb2`), and the checkout-scope delta was independently ACCEPTed by `review_pr302` (SHA-256 `26ce020bdc1f6865e194f02e45c6889eaa32415cc786a457fbcfae1ddaa78605`, tests not run). PR #302 CodeQL and JS/TS checks pass; Node 22/24 CI and Entire are running. TypeScript `--noEmit` and `git diff --check` passed on the prior delta; no local suite was run under the active SUITE claim.\n\n{\"conclusion\":\"NEUTRAL\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/fde0b7b98fc1bde15db3bc4a0afbe85e5ccf8d8f\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"state\":null}\ntest(\"Entire\"; null) cannot be applied to: null\n","exit_code":1,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":557950916}},"started_at_ms":1793216505441,"completed_at_ms":1793216506999}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:41:48.515Z","ordinal":462272,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18408-7263-7d01-a593-0090c7535bde","call_id":"call_82f9e6a8d4864aa781df703b9b9d4cfe","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 1637)\nTotal output lines: 23\n\n## v1/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:15 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) is still running its Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. No post-merge CI conclusion is available yet. The last completed exact-main run is CI [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) and CodeQL [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) on prior main `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; those passed source CI, Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke, version synchronization, and the requirements checker. On that prior revision, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #305 changed operation restart behavior and tests, not requirement rows; the current-main run must still finish before claiming its exact-source gates passed. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check failed only because the review trail lacked approval; that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it at `41a63b4cfbd8c2ec40f384de28db4bea0faee49a` on base `8580c821`. At this observation, PR #308 Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed; Linux and Entire Gates were still running. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on base `8580c821`; JavaScript…437 tokens truncated…, human terminal, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n\n**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n\nThe checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence; their source revision, PR, CI, and qualification statements are superseded by this observation.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 16:25 UTC; superseded)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`. Exact-head CI run [40720824591](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824591) passed the Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; the Linux packaging/reproducibility job was still running at observation time. CodeQL run [40720824319](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40720824319) passed. The CI jobs completed `sync-version --check` and the requirements checker successfully on this source. These results qualify the source revision only; they do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n**Release PRs:** PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) is merged at `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`, included in current main. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) is based on `145d464` at exact head `49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c`; its latest follow-up scopes checkout to the nested workspace and extends the regression to preserve both staged and unstaged sibling state. The prior nested-index delta at `662d084` was independently ACCEPTed (SHA-256 `61f4e40bc135152ffa003c82bdc31fc15703542b5bd9ba3b67f7b6b1edae1cb2`), and the checkout-scope delta was independently ACCEPTed by `review_pr302` (SHA-256 `26ce020bdc1f6865e194f02e45c6889eaa32415cc786a457fbcfae1ddaa78605`, tests not run). PR #302 CodeQL and JS/TS checks pass; Node 22/24 CI and Entire are running. TypeScript `--noEmit` and `git diff --check` passed on the prior delta; no local suite was run under the active SUITE claim.\n\n{\"conclusion\":\"NEUTRAL\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/fde0b7b98fc1bde15db3bc4a0afbe85e5ccf8d8f\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"state\":null}\ntest(\"Entire\"; null) cannot be applied to: null\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","create_time":1793216508.5157816}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
