{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:43:47.501Z","ordinal":462322,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae25069247081a0b43e98b4f2f68ea7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_d0e4eb1c61d44a9a9d3ce11b5d445a61","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:15 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:43 UTC)\\n@@\\n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) is still running its Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. No post-merge CI conclusion is available yet. The last completed exact-main run is CI [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) and CodeQL [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) on prior main `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; those passed source CI, Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke, version synchronization, and the requirements checker. On that prior revision, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #305 changed operation restart behavior and tests, not requirement rows; the current-main run must still finish before claiming its exact-source gates passed. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) passed the Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices; its `linux-x86_64` job is still running the CLI test suite. CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. The last completed exact-main run is CI [40733687806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687806) and CodeQL [40733687484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40733687484) on prior main `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; those passed source CI, Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke, version synchronization, and the requirements checker. On that prior revision, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #305 changed operation restart behavior and tests, not requirement rows; the exact-main Linux job remains pending. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\\n@@\\n-**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check failed only because the review trail lacked approval; that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it at `41a63b4cfbd8c2ec40f384de28db4bea0faee49a` on base `8580c821`. At this observation, PR #308 Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed; Linux and Entire Gates were still running. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on base `8580c821`; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while Node 22/24 and Entire Gates were still running. PR #300's prior head `a285ebedc449e6a64687bb763b3ecfac38f2e675` had Node 22/24 in progress and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed; this readiness correction merges current main and requires fresh exact-head checks. Source PR checks are separate from release qualification.\\n+**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its Entire Gates check concluded **NEUTRAL** (“No trail tracks this branch”); that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146. PR #302 was closed unmerged. PR #308 supersedes it at head `aa86c943f9f2326912c12f87b9a2bece65feb914` on current main `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Its CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, and requirements enforcement passed; Node 22/24 suites are in the CLI test stage, and Linux packaging has not started. Independent agent source review accepted the exact diff (SHA-256 `9b8e1e2723b9168e5cfd7c34fce4cd05e7dbe84bf6c25e29c97e9b673d297ca1`); GitHub auto-merge is enabled but remains gated on required checks. PR #309 remains at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on stale base `8580c821`; Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed while its Linux job runs the CLI test suite. PR #300 remains at `64ffe5ec275d755b61f0bdcff45fe3ef0b2a4d9f` on current main; Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed while its Linux job runs the CLI test suite. This readiness correction needs a factual wording fix and fresh exact-head checks. Source PR checks are separate from release qualification.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","create_time":1793216617.1442387}}}
