{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:53:06.439Z","ordinal":462696,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae2529fa51081a08cf741fa4d6292ef","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. I won’t wait for a second human reviewer or ask you to arrange one. I’ll use a distinct agent for independent code review where the release process permits it; that reviewer accepted PR #308’s exact local candidate.\n\nThe focused checkpoint restore suite passed **77/77**. Exact-head CI is still running on PR #308’s previous pushed revision, so I’m holding the reviewed fix locally until those full-suite jobs finish. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; no RC or release acceptance is being claimed."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793217184295,"completed_at_ms":1793217186439}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:53:06.443Z","ordinal":462697,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae2529fa51081a08cf741fa4d6292ef","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Understood. I won’t wait for a second human reviewer or ask you to arrange one. I’ll use a distinct agent for independent code review where the release process permits it; that reviewer accepted PR #308’s exact local candidate.\n\nThe focused checkpoint restore suite passed **77/77**. Exact-head CI is still running on PR #308’s previous pushed revision, so I’m holding the reviewed fix locally until those full-suite jobs finish. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; no RC or release acceptance is being claimed.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","create_time":1793217183.677168,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae2529fa51081a08cf741fa4d6292ef","turn_id":"01a18405-0795-7761-83bc-7e851bfd6fd4","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a18412-ca8b-73f2-a9a8-ccac05e6b610","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22041}}
