{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:54:55.604Z","ordinal":462732,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18413-b547-7920-8748-309358a4fc4e","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f4ef8f7f-5865-429c-955c-c53ceea0e43c","process_id":"80000","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --json state,title,updatedAt,assignees,comments --jq '{state,title,updatedAt,assignees:[.assignees[].login],comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' && gh pr view 300 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,statusCheckRollup,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}' && gh pr view 309 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,statusCheckRollup,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --json state,title,updatedAt,assignees,comments --jq '{state,title,updatedAt,assignees:[.assignees[].login],comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' && gh pr view 300 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,statusCheckRollup,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}' && gh pr view 309 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,statusCheckRollup,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Public metadata-only update; no held-out payloads or private validators were accessed.\\n\\nCurrent integration is `cf05322cc0368af900b2fb425852daa2d0de403e`. On this exact source, requirements enforcement and RC10 version synchronization pass; CodeQL passes, while post-merge CI is still running. Exact-RC qualification has not started.\\n\\nCustody acceptance remains unresolved. Please confirm metadata only:\\n1. The currently assigned independent author and custodian, or whether a handoff is needed.\\n2. Whether all 40 tasks, approved category coverage, setup, and reference validation are complete and accepted.\\n3. Whether private payload/validator integrity and provenance, author-session independence/exposure history, effective store access restrictions, and task/evaluator separation are accepted.\\n4. Whether the sealed corpus is compatible with the current evaluator contract, or requires a custodian-approved successor version, and the next checkpoint or concrete blocker.\\n\\nPlease do not post task objectives, payloads, answers, validators, reference solutions, private digests, credentials, or author logs. Do not modify the sealed corpus in place. Held-out qualification remains closed pending independent custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-27T18:47:09Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up: the last custody status request was posted on 2026-10-27 18:47 UTC and the issue remains unassigned. Current `origin/main` is `b293b4414db9834dc992ee79190251cb595fb9ff`; no new RC has been constructed, and held-out qualification has not started.\\n\\nPlease provide safe status metadata only:\\n\\n1. Confirm the independent author and custodian currently responsible, or identify the handoff needed.\\n2. Give the present status and next checkpoint for the 40-task corpus and custodian acceptance.\\n3. Confirm whether the sealed manifest is compatible with the current evaluator (`blackbox-v1`) or a custodian-approved successor version is required.\\n4. Identify any concrete blocker requiring coordinator action.\\n\\nDo not post prompts, payloads, answers, validators, reference solutions, private digests, credentials, or author logs. Do not modify the sealed corpus in place. Public manifest metadata does not substitute for private custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T12:42:10Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only coordination follow-up: the last custodian status request was posted at 2026-10-28 12:42 UTC; issue #1 remains unassigned. Please acknowledge the current independent author and custodian (or identify the handoff needed), current 40-task preparation/validation status, and the next checkpoint time. Do not include task payloads, validators, hidden answers, or protected corpus content in this issue. Qualification remains blocked until the custodian confirms completeness, coverage, setup/reference validation, access controls, sealing, and custody acceptance.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T14:23:15Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-28T14:23:15Z\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"headRefOid\":\"f3957a67ac8f9b5ea1e60be2494b9402d943230f\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"headRefOid\":\"aace981bc3f46e1