havior checks are still required. No terminal cells run yet.), updated 56 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 on current base 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0, head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5. Independent exact-diff review ACCEPT (hash 9dbb076ccafb1655462d9043311d5ece1fb112389ea571b3a3bf10369e839999); four RC10 evidence files unchanged and five checksums verified. Exact-head CodeQL and JS/TS passed; Node22/24 in progress; Entire in progress; Linux not yet present. Historical RC10 evidence only; no acceptance promotion.), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=PR #300 head f3957a67ac8f9b5ea1e60be2494b9402d943230f on base 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0. Corrected PR305 GitHub Entire conclusion to NEUTRAL and refreshed observed 19:43 source/PR state. Independent re-review ACCEPT, exact diff SHA-256 1b9a0c36d140acfcbf297583e744e28c614cf51102b9cf7a7e42d57aba0f3f4a. Exact-head CodeQL passed; Node22/Node24 and Entire in progress; JS/TS passed. Linux job has not appeared yet. No merge; acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated 5 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Do not broaden this into the separate codebase-review wish list. On current main, ACCEPTANCE.md §§6.1–6.4 define 40 sealed T2 tasks, 8 T3 tasks ×5 runs, and 9 T4 fault classes ×5 with frozen thresholds. PR #16 manifest is public, but Issue #1 is still OPEN/unassigned with last custodian request at 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC and no later response. No custody acceptance or held-out qualification is established. Remains blocked on custodian metadata/acceptance and a qualified exact RC; do not access payloads.), updated 25 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Refresh authoritative release state after Entire review (details=Verified 2026-10-28: local shared checkout HEAD 31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f is main