ond human reviewer is required by branch rules. Do not push until current full-suite run settles to avoid overlapping suites; then push and require exact-head CI. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Screenshot artifacts are waived by the user's explicit instruction. The 15 terminal/size cells and seven behavior checks remain required and unrun. Historical preflight only covered RC10; rerun against an accepted successor RC before qualification.), updated 3 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 on current base 13e45a0. Independent review ACCEPT, evidence files unchanged, five checksums verified. CodeQL+JS/TS pass; Node22/24 running; Entire running; Linux not yet present. Protected auto-merge enabled, gated by required checks. RC10 evidence only.), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=PR #300 head f3957a67 on base 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0; independent exact-diff ACCEPT. CodeQL+JS/TS pass; Node22/24 running; Entire running; Linux not yet present. Protected GitHub auto-merge enabled, gated by required checks. Main CI run 40751988282 is now SUCCESS on exact main 13e45a0 (all three jobs).), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Do not broaden this into the separate codebase-review wish list. On current main, ACCEPTANCE.md §§6.1–6.4 define 40 sealed T2 tasks, 8 T3 tasks ×5 runs, and 9 T4 fault classes ×5 with frozen thresholds. PR #16 manifest is public, but Issue #1 is still OPEN/unassigned with last custodian request at 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC and no later response. No custody acceptance or held-out qualification is established. Remains blocked on custodian metadata/acceptance and a qualified exact RC; do not access payloads.), upda