{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:06:46.906Z","ordinal":463051,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1841e-ce22-7d92-a5fe-fbad43f8e0cd","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-4e5dd549-fa47-498f-8e80-9b1fd920cc0c","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.0.0 release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release\n  - [doing] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=PR #308 remote head 2c1b2dfa on base 13e45a0; Node22/24 run 40757432379 still active. Local owned candidate 9829c61 has exact-diff independent ACCEPT; focused test 77/77 is owner-reported without retained log. SUITE currently claimed by kimi-main for stale-journal work. Do not overlap; do not push while remote suites active; user-facing release tasks remain incomplete. Entire owner approval unresolved.), updated 3 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH preflight from current runner reached mike@10.0.8.3 and verified active local Wayland session 7 for mike. Installed terminals: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0. Host can host the five-environment 80x24/40x14/200x60 matrix. No cells run; exact successor RC is not built yet. Screenshots waived by user's explicit instruction; terminal behavior checks remain required.), updated 2 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 on current base 13e45a0. Independent review ACCEPT, evidence files unchanged, five checksums verified. CodeQL+JS/TS pass; Node22/24 running; Entire running; Linux not yet present. Protected auto-merge enabled, gated by required checks. RC10 evidence only.), updated 9 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=PR #300 head f3957a67 on base 13e45a0, exact diff independent ACCEPT. CodeQL, JS/TS and Node22 pass; Node24 in progress; Entire in progress; Linux not yet present. Protected auto-merge enabled but remains gated. Exact main CI 40751988282 passed all three jobs.), updated 3 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Refresh 2026-10-28: GitHub Issue #1 remains OPEN/unassigned with no custodian response after the 14:23 UTC metadata-only request. Public PR #16/manifest confirms sealed 40-task T2 metadata, but the last custody follow-up on PR #16 reports a compatibility blocker: sealed corpus uses legacy in-process hidden commands while current evaluator requires isolated blackbox-v1. Custodian must confirm a compatible independently authored/accepted version or establish a separately versioned successor/scope-approved evaluator contract change; do not modify sealed corpus or read private payloads. T3 public metadata lists eight tasks, but custodian must confirm ACCEPTANCE §6.3 five-run/60-step/two-compaction criteria and setup/reference validation. Qualification remains closed.), updated 3 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Refresh authoritative release state after Entire review (details=Verified 2026-10-28: local shared checkout HEAD 31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f is main, dirty, and 1407 commits behind origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0; preserve it. PR300 head 64ffe5ec exact on current base; Node22/24, JS/TS and CodeQL pass, Linux in progress, Entire in progress; live PR comment records CHANGES_REQUIRED on diff hash 782212..., while independent reviewer agent returned ACCEPT for same diff, so review disposition needs reconciliation before merge. PR308 head aa86c943 current base has independent CHANGES_REQUIRED P2 at checkpoint_restore.test.ts:209 (glob pathspec), required Node22/24 still running; do not touch active owner's claim. PR309 head 65b4e1d9 remains based on stale 8580c821, Node22/24+JS/TS+CodeQL passed, Linux and Entire in progress; archive evidence is RC10-only. SUITE claim held by kimi-main; no overlapping suite. Release acceptance IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC/publication.), updated 24 minutes ago"}]},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":33158471}},"started_at_ms":1793218006872,"completed_at_ms":1793218006906}}
