h 9829c61 and require new exact-head checks.), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH preflight from current runner reached mike@10.0.8.3 and verified active local Wayland session 7 for mike. Installed terminals: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0. Host can host the five-environment 80x24/40x14/200x60 matrix. No cells run; exact successor RC is not built yet. Screenshots waived by user's explicit instruction; terminal behavior checks remain required.), updated 2 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 on current main 13e45a0. Independent review ACCEPT, evidence files unchanged, five checksums verified. CodeQL+JS/TS pass. Node22/24 and Entire in progress; Linux not yet present at last poll. Auto-merge enabled but only required checks gate merge. RC10 historical evidence only.), updated 1 minute ago\n  - [doing] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=PR #300 head f3957a67 on base 13e45a0, exact diff independently ACCEPTED. CodeQL, JS/TS and Node22 pass; Node24 and Entire in progress; Linux not yet present. Auto-merge enabled but required CI not finished. Main CI run 40751988282 passed all required jobs. Entire Gates is not a required branch rule.), updated 1 minute ago\n- ...1 more line; read them with work_state_read"}]},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":34666514}},"started_at_ms":1793218031135,"completed_at_ms":1793218031170}}
