release download redirect validation. XERJ located cli/src/upgrade.ts:623-675 and cli/test/upgrade_safety.test.ts:153-190. Direct origin/main inspection confirms release-assets.githubusercontent.com is accepted only for /github-production-release-asset/ paths and tests assert signed redirects work while not forwarding credentials to the asset host. No implementation was needed; this addresses the historical RC7 error path, not current exact-RC qualification.\\\"}'\"}],\"isError\":false}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18422-99d5-74d1-8392-e2c348b8135f","create_time":1793218335.9512506}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
