{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:14:32.897Z","ordinal":463284,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18422-99d5-74d1-8392-e2c348b8135f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-59db272c-ebe2-44cb-b26d-3b37a5fd511f","process_id":"44380","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028 diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028 diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex 000e75cd..9a14c4e1 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,12 +1,12 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 19:43 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:12 UTC)\n \n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) has completed Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices successfully; Linux packaging is still running. CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on this exact SHA. The source requirements check passed on this exact revision with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. Source-stage evidence does not qualify an installed release candidate.\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) and CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on that SHA. The source requirements check passed on this revision with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source-stage results do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n \n-**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307's head was `88bf19c817f8de7461faf9826e405e52630bb08f`; its actual merge commit is `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent source-review checks passed. Its GitHub Entire Gates check concluded **NEUTRAL** (“No trail tracks this branch”); that check is not required by protected-branch ruleset 25340146, consistent with the documented PR #307 disposition. PR #302 was closed unmerged; PR #308 supersedes it and is at `aa86c943f9f2326912c12f87b9a2bece65feb914` on current base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Its Node 22/24 matrices are running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. Independent review found a P2 regression-test defect at `cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts:209`: `git add file[ab].txt` interprets brackets as pathspec glob syntax, so the literal filename is not staged. PR #309 is at `65b4e1d9e379b630dc33acc714b7cbfa4e17fc6b` on stale base `8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b`; Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed, while Linux and Entire Gates remain in progress. PR #300 is this readiness correction; on exact head `64ffe5ec275d755b61f0bdcff45fe3ef0b2a4d9f`, Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL passed, with Linux and Entire Gates still running before this correction. Source PR checks are separate from release qualification.\n+**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; its GitHub Entire Gates check concluded **NEUTRAL** (“No trail tracks this branch”). PR #302 was closed unmerged. PR #308 supersedes it and is open at `2c1b2dfa6b10f736367020a86228ab64a4173500` on current base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Exact-head CI run [40757432379](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757432379) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed. A locally reviewed follow-up commit `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` fixes a glob-sensitive test fixture but is not on the PR head; its focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log, so exact-head CI must cover it before integration. PR #309 is open at `aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5` on the current base. Run [40758300812](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40758300812) has Node 24 passing and Node 22 still running; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed. PR #300 is open at `f3957a67ac8f9b5ea1e60be2494b9402d943230f` on the current base. Run [40757603196](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757603196) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. A fresh checkpoint accuracy correction was posted on PR #300 (comment [6479279112](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6479279112)); this local update addresses the stale PR heads and main-CI status identified there. Source PR checks are distinct from release qualification.\n \n-**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) completed successfully (all jobs passed) for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence artifact reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for the six compared outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The current requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; ledger disposition remains for its owner to reconcile. RC10 evidence applies only to RC10 and does not establish cross-runner qualification for a successor RC. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned; its latest custodian status request is unanswered as of 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC. Held-out custody acceptance and T2/T3/T4 qualification therefore remain unverified. The manual terminal matrix remains 0/15; no genuine operator cell results are recorded. Remaining standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, human terminal, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n+**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) passed for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for six outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; its owner must reconcile that disposition. RC10 evidence does not establish successor-RC qualification. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (last updated 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC); no custodian acceptance or held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification is established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15; the user waived screenshot artifacts, while terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, required human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n \n **Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n \n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28362}},"started_at_ms":1793218472896,"completed_at_ms":1793218472897}}
