; the user waived screenshot artifacts, while terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, required human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n \n **Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n \n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18422-99d5-74d1-8392-e2c348b8135f","create_time":1793218474.180044}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
