{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:38:59.544Z","ordinal":464036,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18432-af9c-7882-80ce-70535521cb1b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae25d62b28481a0918184c15f002ae5","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR #309 is merged at **`b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af`**, adding independently reviewed, checksummed RC10 ChatGPT provider evidence. Its required checks passed; it does not qualify a successor RC.\n\nCI is still running on that new main commit. Exact-head Node test matrices are also running for PR #308 (`9829c61d`) and PR #300 (`c8df3743`). The readiness document needs another refresh because it predates PR #309’s merge; I’ll update it after these checks settle.\n\nThe held-out audit confirms the sealed corpus still uses legacy hidden checks that current qualification preflight rejects. Issue #1 has no custodian response or handoff. No payloads were accessed. **Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; release remains gated.**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793219938744,"completed_at_ms":1793219939544}}
