{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:40:01.261Z","ordinal":464040,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a18432-af9c-7882-80ce-70535521cb1b","turn_id":"01a18432-af9c-7882-80ce-70535521cb1b","last_agent_message":"PR #309 is merged at **`b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af`**, adding independently reviewed, checksummed RC10 ChatGPT provider evidence. Its required checks passed; it does not qualify a successor RC.\n\nCI is still running on that new main commit. Exact-head Node test matrices are also running for PR #308 (`9829c61d`) and PR #300 (`c8df3743`). The readiness document needs another refresh because it predates PR #309’s merge; I’ll update it after these checks settle.\n\nThe held-out audit confirms the sealed corpus still uses legacy hidden checks that current qualification preflight rejects. Issue #1 has no custodian response or handoff. No payloads were accessed. **Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; release remains gated.**","started_at":1793219276,"completed_at":1793220001,"duration_ms":724528,"time_to_first_token_ms":3103}}
