{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:49:13.811Z","ordinal":464321,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae25fbbd3c081a09b03bdb19ce61c7a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_575e205be4464e9fa62a1d66947387d6","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:18 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:49 UTC)\\n \\n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) and CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on that SHA. The source requirements check passed on this revision with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source-stage results do not qualify an installed release candidate.\\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af`, the PR #309 merge commit. Main CI run [40764779353](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40764779353) is running on this exact SHA; its `sync-version --check` and requirements-check steps passed, and Node 22/24 test matrices are in progress. CodeQL run [40764779313](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40764779313) passed. An isolated-HOME `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` run on this exact SHA passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. This is source-stage evidence only.\\n \\n-**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; its GitHub Entire Gates check concluded **NEUTRAL** (“No trail tracks this branch”). PR #302 was closed unmerged. PR #308 supersedes it and is open at `2c1b2dfa6b10f736367020a86228ab64a4173500` on current base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Exact-head CI run [40757432379](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757432379) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed. The PR head fixes the `globName` test by staging it with the literal `:(literal)` pathspec. A separate local follow-up commit `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` applies literal staging to the `magicName` fixture and asserts that it entered the index; this follow-up is not on the PR head. Its focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log, so that additional fixture change still needs exact-head checks before integration. PR #309 is open at `aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5` on the current base. Run [40758300812](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40758300812) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed, and Linux packaging/tests are in progress. PR #300 is open at `f3957a67ac8f9b5ea1e60be2494b9402d943230f` on the current base. Run [40757603196](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757603196) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. A fresh checkpoint accuracy correction was posted on PR #300 (comment [6479279112](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6479279112)); this local update addresses the stale PR heads and main-CI status identified there. Source PR checks are distinct from release qualification.\\n+**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`; PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`; PR #305 merged as `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. PR #302 was closed unmerged and superseded by PR #308. PR #308 is open at `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40763991304](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40763991304) has Node 22 passed and Node 24 still running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, with Linux checks not yet complete. The follow-up applies literal staging to the `magicName` fixture and asserts index membership. Its change has independent review ACCEPT; an earlier focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log. PR #309 merged at 20:36 UTC as `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed; it adds the checksummed RC10 ChatGPT-plan provider evidence. PR #300 is open at `c8df374334bc50ed6dc3a3904cb4c52cf27e7d93` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40762803901](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40762803901) has Node 22/24 passed and Linux tests in progress, and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. A review identified stale PR #300 head/status text in the prior checkpoint; this update corrects it. Source PR checks remain distinct from release qualification.\\n@@\\n-**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) passed for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for six outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; its owner must reconcile that disposition. RC10 evidence does not establish successor-RC qualification. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (last updated 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC); no custodian acceptance or held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification is established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15; the user waived screenshot artifacts, while terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, required human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\\n+**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) passed for immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04/24.04. Its evidence reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for six outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open, so its owner must reconcile that disposition. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor RC. PR #309's merged provider evidence also applies only to RC10. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (last updated 2026-10-28 20:25 UTC); the latest request for a custodian checkpoint or handoff remains unanswered. No custodian acceptance or held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification is established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15; screenshot artifacts were waived, but terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1843d-be16-7a30-8bd0-717d10d5833e","create_time":1793220539.8285575}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:49:13.854Z","ordinal":464322,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1843d-be16-7a30-8bd0-717d10d5833e","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-398039ae-9bb0-4ebc-9bb8-373066207d87","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,9 +2,9 @@\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:18 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:49 UTC)\n \n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) and CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on that SHA. The source requirements check passed on this revision with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source-stage results do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af`, the PR #309 merge commit. Main CI run [40764779353](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40764779353) is running on this exact SHA; its `sync-version --check` and requirements-check steps passed, and Node 22/24 test matrices are in progress. CodeQL run [40764779313](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40764779313) passed. An isolated-HOME `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` run on this exact SHA passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. This is source-stage evidence only.\n \n-**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` (merge commit `145d464dd819a20bf918dfbb4f0176f2c4840a08`). PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`. PR #305 merged at `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; its GitHub Entire Gates check concluded **NEUTRAL** (“No trail tracks this branch”). PR #302 was closed unmerged. PR #308 supersedes it and is open at `2c1b2dfa6b10f736367020a86228ab64a4173500` on current base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. Exact-head CI run [40757432379](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757432379) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed. The PR head fixes the `globName` test by staging it with the literal `:(literal)` pathspec. A separate local follow-up commit `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` applies literal staging to the `magicName` fixture and asserts that it entered the index; this follow-up is not on the PR head. Its focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log, so that additional fixture change still needs exact-head checks before integration. PR #309 is open at `aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5` on the current base. Run [40758300812](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40758300812) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript passed, and Linux packaging/tests are in progress. PR #300 is open at `f3957a67ac8f9b5ea1e60be2494b9402d943230f` on the current base. Run [40757603196](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40757603196) has Node 22 and Node 24 passing; Linux packaging/tests remain in progress. A fresh checkpoint accuracy correction was posted on PR #300 (comment [6479279112](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300#issuecomment-6479279112)); this local update addresses the stale PR heads and main-CI status identified there. Source PR checks are distinct from release qualification.\n+**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`; PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`; PR #305 merged as `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. PR #302 was closed unmerged and superseded by PR #308. PR #308 is open at `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40763991304](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40763991304) has Node 22 passed and Node 24 still running; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, with Linux checks not yet complete. The follow-up applies literal staging to the `magicName` fixture and asserts index membership. Its change has independent review ACCEPT; an earlier focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log. PR #309 merged at 20:36 UTC as `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed; it adds the checksummed RC10 ChatGPT-plan provider evidence. PR #300 is open at `c8df374334bc50ed6dc3a3904cb4c52cf27e7d93` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40762803901](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40762803901) has Node 22/24 passed and Linux tests in progress, and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. A review identified stale PR #300 head/status text in the prior checkpoint; this update corrects it. Source PR checks remain distinct from release qualification.\n \n-**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) passed for the published RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Its machine-readable evidence reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for six outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open; its owner must reconcile that disposition. RC10 evidence does not establish successor-RC qualification. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (last updated 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC); no custodian acceptance or held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification is established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15; the user waived screenshot artifacts, while terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, required human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance gates remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n+**Qualification and release:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains the latest release; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Official cross-runner run [40564959805](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40564959805) passed for immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, rebuilding on Ubuntu 22.04/24.04. Its evidence reports `REQ-REL-114` / `ACC-SUP-08` `PASS` and matching hashes for six outputs, including the published archive and `sbom.cdx.json`; see the [RC10 reproducibility record](../reviews/evidence/v1/REQ-REL-114-rc10-20261027/README.md). The requirements ledger still marks `REQ-REL-114` `UNV`/open, so its owner must reconcile that disposition. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor RC. PR #309's merged provider evidence also applies only to RC10. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (last updated 2026-10-28 20:25 UTC); the latest request for a custodian checkpoint or handoff remains unanswered. No custodian acceptance or held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification is established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15; screenshot artifacts were waived, but terminal behavior checks remain unrun. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC qualification, human terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding. Stable publication remains gated.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793220553850,"completed_at_ms":1793220553854}}
