{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:54:18.240Z","ordinal":464537,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1843d-be16-7a30-8bd0-717d10d5833e","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-134eaeee-e0fe-4f60-a62c-2499ea30d93d","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.0.0 release","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled, current branch main. entire search unavailable because token refresh cannot access org.freedesktop.secrets. entire checkpoint list --outgoing says checkpoint_push_disabled=true and reports 637 checkpoints not on origin. Preserve shared dirty checkout; local changes belong to active Antigravity session per pending checkpoint records., integration_head=b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af (PR #309 merge). Main CI 40764779353: sync-version and non-enforce requirements step pass; Node22/24 suites active. Exact-main local isolated-home `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 explicitly deferred to RC qualification., updated 7 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=Exact head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8: Node22 and Node24 PASS, Linux package/test job now IN_PROGRESS in run 40763991304; JS/TS and CodeQL PASS. Independent review ACCEPT, no tests by reviewer. SUITE claim still kimi-main; coordinator did not run local suite.), updated 4 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH preflight from current runner reached mike@10.0.8.3 and verified active local Wayland session 7 for mike. Installed terminals: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0. Host can host the five-environment 80x24/40x14/200x60 matrix. No cells run; exact successor RC is not built yet. Screenshots waived by user's explicit instruction; terminal behavior checks remain required.), updated 50 minutes ago\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md and confirmed RC10 E5 OpenRouter small live task PASS on exact signed RC10 artifact (16ee8ca36438; published archive SHA-256 444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7). Synthetic JS slug task had 7 provider requests; declared verifier passed and independent validation passed added Unicode/emoji/whitespace assertions. README records earlier failed attempts separately and explicitly limits the pass to one small task. It points to RC10 provider verification receipts dated 2026-10-27; no redundant live inference run performed.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 exact head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 independently ACCEPTed; five evidence checksums verified. Required Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL passed. Merged at 2026-10-28T20:36:21Z as b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af. Main CI run 40764779353 is in progress. RC10-only historical evidence.), updated 14 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=Remote PR #300 at c8df374 on stale base 13e45; new main is b3dea1a after PR #309 merged. PR #300 exact run 40762803901 Node22 passed; Node24 passed; Linux cargo tests/build in progress; CodeQL/JS-TS pass. Current READINESS.md still incorrectly says PR300=f395, PR308=2c1b, PR309 open; independent review flagged stale PR #300 state. Refresh after active exact-head runs/PR308 integration, then obtain exact-diff review and push through claimed branch.), updated 9 minutes ago\n  - [done] Reconcile exact requirements gate on current main (details=Verified on detached clean worktree at exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0 using isolated HOME: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce exits 0; 123 rows, tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7. Deferred to exact-RC qualification: AGT-002, AGT-010, PRV-003, REL-003, REL-005, AGT-110, PRV-111, REL-114, QUAL-101, QUAL-107, QUAL-108, QUAL-109. This is a source gate only, not acceptance.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Confirm Nexus runtime identity defect remediation (details=Independent read-only review ACCEPT for PR #273 exact head 674e5bf37b74ebfe3f41a4390a8735b6f6f23abd, merged as e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2; diff SHA-256 ce628b0b1815e9a57fb3d5e6fa760e3eb7d2bb87bfa86247caad9621781f1876. Prompt-level instructions and activated-skill host tag are covered with Claude-named model/skill regression. Review notes live model compliance and successor-RC behavior remain unverified. Exact PR checks had passed per GitHub; no reviewer suite run.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile user-requested operation maintainability and quality scope (details=Verified on exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: capability definitions split into category files (PR286); convergence scheduler extracted (PR285); runner split across revalidation/execution/persistence (PR287); operator config via ~/.config/nexus/config.json (PR289); DecisionRejected behavior and recovery documented (PR293); runtime diagnostic handling fixed/tested (PR296). Current files are ~10 KB capabilities, ~16 KB operation model, ~24 KB scheduler, ~22 KB runner. Generated DAG invariant tests explore 100 fixed seeds; real-agent lifecycle integration tests exist. No remaining empty catch blocks in the operation runner modules. These are source-level observations; current main CI/full-suite results still pending.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Fresh Issue #1 check at 2026-10-28 20:24 UTC still OPEN/unassigned; no response to prior metadata-only request at 14:23. Sent a concise follow-up asking whether the independent author/custodian is active, for the next checkpoint, or for the authorized custody handoff path. Comment 6479873007; no payloads/answers/private digests requested. Public 40-task manifest is not custody acceptance; compatibility blocker remains legacy hidden command format vs blackbox-v1 evaluator. Qualification remains unstarted and protected.), updated 29 minutes ago\n  - [done] Refresh authoritative release state after Entire review (details=Current authoritative state refreshed 2026-10-28 20:06 UTC. origin/main=13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0; its CI run 40751988282 passed all required jobs. PR300 head f3957a67 and PR309 head aace981b are based on current main with Node22/24 still in progress at last check. PR308 head 2c1b2dfa remains on current base, Node24 succeeded, Node22 still running in run 40757432379. Main rules require Node22, Node24, Linux only and zero approving reviews; Entire Gates (including approval/finding signal) is not a required status check and must not be treated as a human reviewer blocker. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS.), updated 47 minutes ago\n  - [done] Verify Nexus host identity is independent of provider/model (details=Confirmed on exact current origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: cli/src/agent.ts:232 injects explicit Nexus Code host identity and prohibits inferring host from provider/model; cli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts covers it. Exact-main CI 40751988282 passed Node22, Node24 and Linux. This is source/CI evidence, not exact-RC qualification.), updated 49 minutes ago\n  - [done] Verify sensitive-checkpoint failure offers operator choices (details=Confirmed on exact current origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: REPL offers read-only, continue without rollback checkpoint, create checkpoint despite sensitive persistence risk, cancel, 