{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:54:36.529Z","ordinal":464551,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1843d-be16-7a30-8bd0-717d10d5833e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae2610a80d881a08320934134a894d3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. We don’t need to block on finding a second human reviewer. The readiness update received an independent review from a separate agent, which accepted it.\n\nI committed the corrected checkpoint locally as `29ce2978` in the claimed PR #300 worktree. It records the current main revision and CI, updates PR #308’s Node 24 result, and keeps acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. The docs-only change passed `git diff --check`; I did not run the test suite while its ownership claim is active.\n\nMain CI, PR #308’s Linux check, and PR #300’s Linux check are still running. The readiness commit is not pushed: the project instructions reserve pushes to the repository owner, and I’m avoiding another CI run while these checks are active. Held-out qualification and terminal checks also remain outstanding, so release acceptance is not claimed."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793220874545,"completed_at_ms":1793220876529}}
