{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:08:07.638Z","ordinal":464943,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1844c-0389-7191-bd33-ba7c92f2b1e0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c70847d2-2850-4cd8-b3b4-f7266f60549f","process_id":"71549","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short && git log --oneline --decorate -4 && git diff --check && git diff --stat origin/main...HEAD && git merge-base origin/main HEAD && rg -n \"Current release checkpoint|PR #308|PR #300|NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE|IN_PROGRESS\" docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -12"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short && git log --oneline --decorate -4 && git diff --check && git diff --stat origin/main...HEAD && git merge-base origin/main HEAD && rg -n \"Current release checkpoint|PR #308|PR #300|NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE|IN_PROGRESS\" docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -12"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"504e0336 (HEAD -> v1/rc-readiness-correction-20261028) Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into v1/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\n29ce2978 docs(release): refresh readiness checkpoint status\nb3dea1a9 (origin/main) Merge pull request #309 from mikeholownych/v1/rc10-chatgpt-provider-evidence-20261028\nc8df3743 (pr/300, origin/v1/rc-readiness-refresh-20261028) docs(release): reconcile readiness checkpoint corrections\n docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | 95 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n 1 file changed, 94 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\nb3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af\n3:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:52 UTC)\n7:**Integrated changes and open PRs:** PR #299 merged as `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`; PR #307 merged as `90837aa5193d7c071066d27ccefd2b2ea2db0aff`; PR #305 merged as `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`. PR #302 was closed unmerged and superseded by PR #308. PR #308 is open at `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40763991304](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40763991304) has Node 22 and Node 24 passed; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, and Linux checks are in progress. The follow-up applies literal staging to the `magicName` fixture and asserts index membership. Its change has independent review ACCEPT; an earlier focused 77/77 result is owner-reported without a retained log. PR #309 merged at 20:36 UTC as `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af` after exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed; it adds the checksummed RC10 ChatGPT-plan provider evidence. PR #300 is open at `c8df374334bc50ed6dc3a3904cb4c52cf27e7d93` on base `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`; exact-head run [40762803901](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40762803901) has Node 22/24 passed and Linux tests in progress, and JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. A review identified stale PR #300 head/status text in the prior checkpoint; this update corrects it. Source PR checks remain distinct from release qualification.\n11:**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Passing source CI and RC10-only provider/reproducibility evidence do not establish release acceptance. Existing publication authorization remains gated by acceptance.\n27:**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source CI is mostly complete on `145d464`; PR #302's latest delta awaits independent review and exact Node 22/24 completion, while #307 has independent source review but exact PR checks remain pending. RC10 has passing, bounded provider and cross-runner evidence, but no accepted RC exists and mandatory qualification remains open. Publication authorization remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n41:**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. PR integration is blocked by required Entire review findings/approvals; exact-RC qualification is additionally blocked by independent held-out custody and the required human terminal matrix. Existing publication authorization remains granted but gated. The checkpoint below is retained as the 13:34 UTC snapshot and is superseded for current CI, requirements, PR checks, local suite result, and release status.\n55:**Disposition:** Engineering convergence remains active; acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`. No RC is accepted and no stable release is published. Public RC10 remains the latest release; the repository target is the GitHub installer (npm publication is inapplicable per operator decision). Continue source remediation and exact-head review/CI, then build and qualify a successor RC only after pre-RC gates and PR #305's restart fix pass; keep all installed-RC gates bound to that exact artifact.\n69:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Held-out T2/T3/T4, remaining live-provider and standalone gates, successor-RC artifact qualification, cross-runner evidence, the 15-cell human terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on these mandatory checks.\n117:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 19:22 UTC)\n125:**Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Exact cross-runner reproducibility passed for immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca`; a successor candidate from current main still requires its own reproducibility run. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\n129:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:31 UTC)\n146:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 15:12 UTC)\n158:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 12:46 UTC)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":4,"nanos":574282122}},"started_at_ms":1793221683063,"completed_at_ms":1793221687638}}
