k and version sync steps passed. PR #300 and #308 checks are accurately distinguished from release qualification. RC10 provider evidence remains clearly scoped to RC10, the prior checkpoint history is preserved, and custody, terminal-matrix, and exact-RC acceptance blockers remain open. `git diff --check` passed.\\n\\n\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1844c-0389-7191-bd33-ba7c92f2b1e0","create_time":1793222525.9043727}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
