{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:22:58.769Z","ordinal":465450,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1844c-0389-7191-bd33-ba7c92f2b1e0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae267b0fdc081a0a165676c961ab64d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. Since this is a single-user repository, I won’t wait for another human reviewer. A separate read-only agent reviewed the readiness change and accepted it; that review does not count as release acceptance.\n\nI pushed commit `8b625522` and opened [PR #310](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/310), with the exact `main` base recorded as `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`. Its required checks are still running or queued, so I have not merged it. Main CI run `40770466028` is also still running; CodeQL run `40770465935` passed. The shared dirty checkout remains untouched.\n\n**Campaign:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`  \n**Acceptance:** `IN_PROGRESS`\n\nThe open held-out, exact-RC, and human terminal gates remain release blockers. I’ll continue with the next actionable work as these checks complete."}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":777,"lineEnd":817,"note":"used Nexus release gating and claim-handling context"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793222577020,"completed_at_ms":1793222578769}}
