{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:31:32.774Z","ordinal":465732,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a18468-7ef6-7763-98c2-d6bd3928c395","turn_id":"01a18468-7ef6-7763-98c2-d6bd3928c395","last_agent_message":"PR #310 now contains the correction at `16f13ba0`. It distinguishes PR #308’s neutral GitHub Entire check from a separate post-merge report of an unresolved high-severity finding in Entire trail 23. The finding’s text remains unavailable, so it is recorded as unevaluated—not resolved. An independent agent re-reviewed the corrected diff and accepted it.\n\nPR #310’s exact-head checks and main CI run `40770466028` are still running. Auto-merge remains enabled; neither has merged yet. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`, and the Entire finding still needs its owner to provide and resolve the finding before successor-RC qualification.","started_at":1793222803,"completed_at":1793223092,"duration_ms":289574,"time_to_first_token_ms":2362}}
