:(.state // .status),conclusion:.conclusion}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git diff --check && sha256sum <(git diff origin/main) && git push origin v1/readiness-post-308-merge-20261028 && gh pr edit 310 --title 'docs(release): reconcile current readiness and qualification evidence' --body-file - <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- Refresh the release checkpoint against exact main `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, including current CI and unresolved qualification gates.\n- Record that PR #308's GitHub Entire check was neutral while a separate post-merge review reports an unresolved high-severity finding in Entire trail 23; the finding itself remains unavailable and unevaluated.\n- Record the runtime identity fix merged in PR #273, clarify that published RC10 predates it, and require successor-RC verification.\n- Apply the owner-authorized screenshot-artifact waiver to v1.0.0 terminal evidence while preserving every interactive check, per-cell verdict, and evidence record.\n- Preserve acceptance as `IN_PROGRESS`; no matrix result, RC acceptance, or stable release is claimed.\n\n## Evidence\n- Independent read-only review ACCEPT on the cumulative diff at base `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, SHA-256 `3f5e1f97256360016663933f14b9e8cee3cfff4d818e96c4fc98cc8a24934f0a`.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- Exact-main CI run 40770466028 and PR-head checks are still in progress; CodeQL passed.\n- No local tests were run for these documentation changes.\nEOF\n gh pr view 310 --json state,url,headRefOid,baseRefOid,autoMergeRequest,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup --jq '{state,url,headRefOid,baseRefOid,autoMerge:.autoMergeRequest.mergeMethod,mergeStateStatus,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name:.name,state:(.state // .status),conclusion:.conclusion}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec  