{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:44:44.863Z","ordinal":466142,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18473-ec48-7c83-b9e5-71dfb1a63e9b","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-ce28cb21-7725-491f-ad20-4f62793dd957","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 (PR #308 merged 2026-10-28T21:15:37Z), entire_search=Entire status confirms enabled and five sessions; `entire auth status` says logged_in=false, one context stored. `entire search` and read-only `entire trail show 23` both fail before retrieval because token refresh requires org.freedesktop.secrets, unavailable here. The unresolved Trail 23 finding cannot be independently inspected from this session. No auth/restart/config changes made., current_main_ci=Refreshed 2026-10-28 21:42 UTC: exact main SHA 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; CI run 40770466028 has Node22 and Node24 jobs SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 still running npm --prefix cli test. CodeQL run 40770465935 passed., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=Remote PR #310 remains open at head 16f13ba079072f195a8f9bde2e85e2e972f8ae5f on exact base 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; JS/TS and CodeQL pass; Node22/24 pending; Entire Gates pending. Local commit b035e716657e467c71a2b1a3ef7981068dea0f0c adds owner-waived screenshot wording to ACCEPTANCE + SPEC-10, independently ACCEPTed with patch hash 2ae9a0d6d0ccd661fbb74378ed5ad1297fd26b6c44f927167c19e142eba1e87e. Local branch ahead 1; project instructions reserve push to owner; exact checks after push remain., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable release., ci_observation=As of 2026-10-28 21:41 UTC, main Linux job 123115317509 remains live on `npm --prefix cli test` (started 21:38:28Z; no failed step). Node22 and Node24 are green. PR310 exact head 16f13ba0 remains open/blocked; its Node22, Node24, Entire Gate checks are in progress, while JS/TS and CodeQL passed., suite_claim=Still held by kimi-main. Latest observed scope updated package and installer smoke with isolated HOME and mock inference only. Do not run tests., updated 2 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated 46 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Fresh Issue #1 check at 2026-10-28 20:24 UTC still OPEN/unassigned; no response to prior metadata-only request at 14:23. Sent a concise follow-up asking whether the independent author/custodian is active, for the next checkpoint, or for the authorized custody handoff path. Comment 6479873007; no payloads/answers/private digests requested. Public 40-task manifest is not custody acceptance; compatibility blocker remains legacy hidden command format vs blackbox-v1 evaluator. Qualification remains unstarted and protected.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [doing] Reconcile doctor D1-D3 report against current main (details=Entire recall plus exact committed origin/main source/test inspection at 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0. D1 appears source-remediated: async opendir/lstat in batches of 128, bounded newest-record parsing, 30s default integrity deadline; committed tests assert event-loop responsiveness, bounded concurrency and deadline. D2 appears source-remediated: index.json is excluded, schema-v2 requires messageLog and rejects messages; schema-v1 keeps messages. D3 has intended distinction: absent /models entry is advisory WARN; --deep performs one inference and upgrades model.available only on success; committed tests cover that exact case. These are committed-source/test evidence, not rerun tests or live reproduction. Next: inspect exact current commit CI/test coverage if needed and reproduce on mike-dev state without altering user data; acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Verify PR #309 integration and main CI (details=PR #309 merged at 2026-10-28T20:36:21Z as b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af after independent ACCEPT and exact-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux package/reproducibility) passed. New main CI 40764779353 and CodeQL 40764779313 are both still in progress. No exact-RC acceptance claim.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [doing] Monitor post-PR-308 main CI and refresh release readiness (details=Exact-main CI 40770466028 still running; Node22/24 passed Rust tests, release build is in progress/passed on Node24 and npm test is running. CodeQL 40770465935 passed. Requirements enforcement and sync-version --check passed on clean detached exact main 10c84df. Readiness update commit 8b625522 on base 10c84df received fresh independent ACCEPT (diff SHA-256 143417ff1bbafe468aacb8864ae1977b237b95d0ccd2af05799954f37eaaa554); owner claim remains active.), updated 21 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Post-308 readiness checkpoint PR (details=PR #310 remains open, exact head 16f13ba079072f195a8f9bde2e85e2e972f8ae5f on exact base 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Independent doc review ACCEPT. JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks pass; Node22/24 and Entire Gates pending. Main exact-SHA CI run 40770466028 still executes npm CLI tests; CodeQL pass. Post-merge Entire trail #23 remains reported with one unresolved high finding, no available finding text. Do not conflate PR check neutral with resolution.), updated 12 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Respect screenshot-artifact waiver; continue terminal behavior qualification (details=User explicitly waived terminal screenshot artifacts for release. This waives screenshots only; live terminal behavior checks and evidence recording remain required. User reported render behavior across tested sizes, with tmux inside GNOME Terminal at 43x13 as the known exception; evaluate whether that human report can satisfy any matrix cells, and do remaining cells on exact successor RC. Current successor RC not built/installed; do not count RC10.), updated 12 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Align acceptance documentation with terminal screenshot-artifact waiver (details=Local commit b035e716657e467c71a2b1a3ef7981068dea0f0c updates ACCEPTANCE.md + SPEC-10. Independent read-only review ACCEPT by /root/rc5_candidate_review; exact patch SHA-256 2ae9a0d6d0ccd661fbb74378ed5ad1297fd26b6c44f927167c19e142eba1e87e; no tests run (docs-only), diff checks pass. All seven manual interactions, zero-failure safety gate for checks 2/5/6, exact-RC/terminal/size binding, per-cell verdict and observations remain mandatory. Repo AGENTS reserves push to owner; commit local and ahead one, pending owner push and exact-head CI/integration.), updated 7 minutes ago\n- nexus-pr302-bare-repo-remediation-20261028: latest_progress=2026-10-28 ~18:10 UTC: Entire Brain retrieval is functional via lexical BM25 although semantic is unavailable; recall confirms the CLI attestation test deliberately treats host-installed gh as an environment condition. The active SUITE run has reached late upgrade/continuity/TUI tests (~33 minutes). Failures so far include eval_hardened (2), REPL approval hardening, ACC-SAFE-01, external package source override (likely no-.git snapshot), and shell NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION precedence; final diagnostics pending. PR300/305 CI matrix, CodeQL, and Linux all PASS; only Entire gates remain pending., next_checkpoint=Wait for full suite exit and capture the final nonzero exit, all assertion text, and test counts. Treat absent .git as an invalid full-suite environment; classify each failure separately. Release SUITE only after the owning process exits. Then request NUL-stdin check-ignore fix/regression in the claim worktree and revalidate in a Git-aware immutable snapshot. Entire trail review API currently fails because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; don't repair/install it without authorization., release_state=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS. No accepted successor RC or stable v1.0.0. Latest public candidate RC10; installed-RC provider/held-out/cross-runner/manual terminal evidence remains incomplete., terminal_setup=Ubuntu desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable over SSH. GUI session active. xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1 installed. RC10 binary at ~/.local/nexus-rc10-qualification/bin/nexus reports 1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438). Opened xterm 80x24 using a disposable workspace as setup only; no manual acceptance evidence collected., review_state=Independent ACCEPT of f8f6983 vs 934ed912, exact diff SHA-256 38425b0e892f4a0741601516b23ca71a768dc4f08ef06955e6f5869ef47d8527, findings 0, tests not run. Review specifically covers staged deletion in assertGitChangesSafe and safe cleanup ordering. A newer uncommitted 10/-2 checkpoint.ts delta was excluded., ci_state=PR308 head 87b560c7: runs 40735401162 and 40735870389 Node22/24 FAILED; Linux skipped; Entire failed due no approvals, failed CI, and one unresolved high finding. PR305 head fde0b7b9 and PR300 head 2b6490f7: Node22/24 PASS; Linux and Entire gates still in progress. Exact main 8580c821 CI and CodeQL now both pass., next_checkpoint2=No tests until SUITE handoff from kimi-main., entire_auth=entire status --json: enabled; five sessions, one active Codex. brain recall effective_engine=bm25_lexical; brain status semantic freshness degraded. entire auth status logged_in=false. Do not attempt installation/config repair; human approval session remains external., suite_claim=codex-root owns SUITE since 2026-10-28 17:46:37Z on v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix, head 1482d6b315129cd46fac61242c2eb91793ed8fd2; focused checkpoint restore validation on immutable snapshot /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-validation-finalfocus-174628, isolated HOME, no inference. No coordinator test execution., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or stable release., current_main_checks=Verified exact origin/main 8580c821f57119768db01614d31cd60e8766468b: CI run 40733687806 SUCCESS, Node22 SUCCESS, Node24 SUCCESS, Linux x86_64 SUCCESS (17:55:45Z); CodeQL 40733687484 SUCCESS., active_suite_failures=Observed on archive snapshot run: eval_hardened two failures; REPL approval hardening; ACC-SAFE-01; external package source override current worktree; CLI attestation env precedence. Final causes not yet emitted. Snapshot has no .git; do not count this run as source qualification., updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [doing] Address PR #302 review finding for nested bare Git repository ancestors (detail=Exact PR head 3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7 is remotely verified and independently ACCEPTED (diff SHA-256 d90aeb05a9f5c5d0a35bfa0f597d96cc39a5f6480e22b20094f7523cd4cacdff). Immutable-snapshot validation: checkpoint_restore 51/51, TypeScript --noEmit PASS, diff-check PASS; isolated HOME and logs retained at /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-3c52580.91oUZ9. CodeQL and JS/TS PASS; Node 22/24 and Entire are pending. PR remains open; no merge.), updated about 8 hours ago\n  - [doing] Close partial nested bare repository config bypass and requalify PR302 (detail=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed working diff SHA-256 28524ef98877b37c8d385d0ede5cfdf682d620515fab4a135e05212985841484. Committed as 72939ec8da37bc22509c8c87ebaacc5de7724f02 and pushed fast-forward to PR302. Isolated-HOME tsc --noEmit and diff-check pass; no tests run due kimi-main SUITE claim. Exact PR checks 40717946373/40717945285 started; Entire reviewer asked to verify exact pushed content and then record own approval if policy allows. Ubuntu read-only Entire inspection showed zero approvals on trail 17 before current head check., next_checkpoint=Wait for exact-head CI and independent Entire reviewer response; obtain explicit SUITE safe-boundary transfer before targeted/full validation. Use valid worktree under /home and CI-style capped tmpfs/runtime fixtures. Do not merge until exact candidate tests, review, and all checks pass.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [doing] Use Entire history before continuing PR #302 checkpoint remediation (latest_progress=2026-10-28: Applied using-entire workflow. Entire status succeeds on shared main (enabled; 637 outgoing checkpoints), but semantic search fails because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable. Isolated PR302 worktree reports Entire not set up. Shared checkout remains untouched. Existing reviewer/owner/claim constraints unchanged., next_checkpoint=Restore the configured secret-service access through its approved host setup or obtain authorized Entire access; rerun Entire search for checkpoint restore history. Preserve PR302 worktree changes until coordinator confirms their ownership. Do not run tests while kimi-main owns SUITE.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [doing] Advance PR302 exact-head remediation and qualification (latest_progress=On 2026-10-28 at 15:50 UTC, PR302 fast-forwarded to f771590b0da201f5d3f83897f9d2d8a0ce5cee91. Independent source reviewer plan05_readonly_review ACCEPTed exact parent-to-head diff SHA 31171bfd. TypeScript noEmit and git diff check pass. Local tests not run because SUITE safe-boundary handoff from kimi-main is unresolved. Exact-head GitHub CI 40720039126 and CodeQL 40720039095 queued; Entire pending, cannot self-approve through the sole owner account. Future timestamps 16:00/16:08/16:12 appended earlier were erroneous and corrected in nexus-claims.log., next_checkpoint=Monitor exact-head CI and Entire status. Obtain Kimi suite-owner safe-boundary release or confirm there is no active suite claim/process, then run targeted checkpoint suite with isolated HOME; preserve evidence and requalify if changes are needed. Do not merge until tests, checks, and independent acceptance pass., release_state=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; origin/main=b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212; PR302 head=f771590b0da201f5d3f83897f9d2d8a0ce5cee91. User confirms sole-user repository; independent code review can come from distinct agent/session, but Entire approval remains pending. Public latest prerelease RC10; no stable v1.0.0.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [doing] Fix nested-workspace restore index scope on PR #302 (detail=Independent review identified read-tree resets sibling index entries during a subdirectory workspace restore. Added scoped index merge and a sibling staged/worktree regression in claimed worktree; diff-check passed. Current TypeScript check unavailable because the worktree has no installed compiler. Active SUITE claim remains kimi-main provider composite focused tests, so no local suite runs.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [doing] Resolve PR302 independent checkpoint review findings (details=Current PR head moved to 934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8 while work proceeded. Draft changes in cli/src/checkpoint.ts and cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts co