{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:45:04.351Z","ordinal":466154,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a18473-ec48-7c83-b9e5-71dfb1a63e9b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae26cdf1ebc81a0bfa195233bafe9bf","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. I won’t require another human account. A non-implementing agent has independently reviewed the readiness changes and accepted them; that addresses source review, while held-out custody and release qualification remain separate gates.\n\nPR #310 is now at `b9a23d5` and open. Its Node 22/24, CodeQL, and Entire checks are still running. Main’s Node 22/24 checks passed; Linux packaging and CLI tests are still running. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\nI also found that the review’s reported diff hash does not match my local hash for the pushed diff. I’ll resolve that discrepancy before citing the hash as exact evidence."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793223903175,"completed_at_ms":1793223904351}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:45:04.356Z","ordinal":466155,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae26cdf1ebc81a0bfa195233bafe9bf","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Understood. I won’t require another human account. A non-implementing agent has independently reviewed the readiness changes and accepted them; that addresses source review, while held-out custody and release qualification remain separate gates.\n\nPR #310 is now at `b9a23d5` and open. Its Node 22/24, CodeQL, and Entire checks are still running. Main’s Node 22/24 checks passed; Linux packaging and CLI tests are still running. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\nI also found that the review’s reported diff hash does not match my local hash for the pushed diff. I’ll resolve that discrepancy before citing the hash as exact evidence.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18473-ec48-7c83-b9e5-71dfb1a63e9b","create_time":1793223903.1351569,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae26cdf1ebc81a0bfa195233bafe9bf","turn_id":"01a18473-ec48-7c83-b9e5-71dfb1a63e9b","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a18479-4c64-7300-b6e1-793add9d2c50","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22191}}
