{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:53:52.682Z","ordinal":466495,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae26eecbc9881a0a6589d60eda53f92","status":"completed","call_id":"call_875fa61435f746f8a0e48fd895f91f9d","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr310-body.md <<'EOF'\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/25/changes/nexus-code/25\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n- Refresh the release checkpoint against exact main `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, including current CI and unresolved qualification gates.\\n- Distinguish PR #308's neutral GitHub Entire check from the separate earlier report of an unresolved high-severity finding on Entire trail 23. A current authenticated read-only query finds the trail open and its Nexus Code change merged, but finding and approval commands cannot retrieve the historical disposition; the finding remains unresolved/unverified.\\n- Record the runtime identity fix merged in PR #273, clarify that published RC10 predates it, and require successor-RC verification.\\n- Apply the owner-authorized screenshot-artifact waiver to v1.0.0 terminal evidence while preserving every interactive check, per-cell verdict, and evidence record.\\n- Preserve acceptance as `IN_PROGRESS`; no matrix result, RC acceptance, or stable release is claimed.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n- Independent read-only review ACCEPTed the cumulative content through `b9a23d51`; the pushed base-to-head patch SHA-256 was `54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec`. The earlier `3f5e...` hash was from a working-tree patch snapshot, not that pushed range.\\n- The follow-up trail-status wording and timestamp were independently reviewed ACCEPT at `5afbae0e`; readiness-file diff SHA-256 `b442c9b4e26296aed41d49f10926f140f170324f6bc8560d787dde8dcfedf692`.\\n- Current cumulative PR diff SHA-256 at `5afbae0e93de7a87a63cb69c2042315ea4d8bb43`: `d60c5ec95dc20b642ff89777ecb520cb04f907459105dc41aef9975c20608913`.\\n- `git diff --check` passed. No local tests were run for these documentation-only changes.\\n- Exact-main CI run 40770466028: Node 22/24 passed; Linux CLI test still in progress. Main CodeQL passed. Fresh exact-head PR checks are running for `5afbae0e`.\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 310 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr310-body.md && gh pr view 310 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,statusCheckRollup,url\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":1800}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","create_time":1793224428.7395287}}}
