help and docs). Fix its operator-workspace checkout: run in a worktree (VER-07a). | `index.ts:663-688`; `evaluator.ts:128` | — |\n| 11 | M5 runs: T2 held-out (5×), T3 (5×), T4 (9×5), standalone subset (PLAN-05), provider verify (DEC-06). Archive everything under `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/<rc>/`. | runbook in ACCEPTANCE §4–§6 | all, RC build |\n| 13 | `eval/standalone/plain_proxy.mjs`: a forward proxy to the gateway. It injects the gateway token server-side. It strips `/v1/models` to `{id,object,owned_by}`, returns 404 for `/v1/tokenize`, and drops `X-AIHost-*` and admission headers. The `--emulate {llamacpp,vllm,ollama}` profiles add that server's `/models`, `/props`, `/api/show` and overflow-error shapes, derived from the real gateway limits. Unit-tested against a mock gateway. | new `eval/standalone/` | — |\n| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3. Archive screenshots. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | RC build |\n\n## PR slices\n\n- **PR-10a:** tasks 1, 2.\n- **PR-10b:** tasks 3, 4, 7.\n- **PR-10c:** tasks 5, 6.\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:36:| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3. Archive screenshots. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | RC build |\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:41:For each cell, archive a screenshot of the approval panel and a screenshot of the post-exit terminal state. Record a separate evidence/result reference where useful. Automated PTY runs and screenshots do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:45:Select exactly one PASS or FAIL for each cell. Add the approval-panel and post-exit screenshot references for every cell. Record failures in the disposition/notes field.\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:47:| # | Terminal environment | Size | Verdict (select one) | Evidence / result reference | Approval-panel screenshot | Post-exit screenshot | Failure disposition / notes |\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:69:- All 15 cells have exactly one verdict and both required screenshots are referenced: [ ] yes  [ ] no\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:75:Mark the §5.3 matrix gate PASS when all 15 verdicts, screenshots, and evidence\ndocs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:84:required screenshots and per-cell evidence are archived. Mark it FAIL if any\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","create_time":1793224668.2381895}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
