 Terminal | 40×14 | [ ] PASS  [ ] FAIL | | |\n+| 15 | GNOME Terminal | 200×60 | [ ] PASS  [ ] FAIL | | |\n \n@@ -68,3 +68,3 @@\n - Any failure on another check requires a written disposition: fix, or a documented known limitation.\n-- All 15 cells have exactly one verdict and both required screenshots are referenced: [ ] yes  [ ] no\n+- All 15 cells have exactly one verdict, check outcomes, and per-cell evidence references: [ ] yes  [ ] no\n - All non-safety failures have a written disposition: [ ] yes  [ ] no  [ ] no such failures\n@@ -74,3 +74,3 @@\n \n-Mark the §5.3 matrix gate PASS when all 15 verdicts, screenshots, and evidence\n+Mark the §5.3 matrix gate PASS when all 15 verdicts, check outcomes, and per-cell evidence\n references are complete, checks 2, 5, and 6 have zero failures, and every\n@@ -83,3 +83,3 @@\n Mark ACC-TUI-MANUAL PASS only when all 15 cell verdicts are PASS and the\n-required screenshots and per-cell evidence are archived. Mark it FAIL if any\n+per-cell outcomes and evidence records are complete. Screenshots are waived per DEC-18. Mark it FAIL if any\n cell is FAIL. Mark it INCOMPLETE when evidence is missing and no cell has\n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -82,3 +82,3 @@\n 7. **REQ-QUAL-107. Standalone and provider matrix.** The live standalone set (a T2 subset of ≥ 10 tasks plus a T4 subset) is run through the gateway-stripping proxy in its plain profile and its emulated-server profiles (DEC-16). `providers verify` is run live for each provider listed as supported (DEC-06). Receipts are archived.\n-8. **REQ-QUAL-108. Terminal matrix.** PTY scripted runs in CI (existing `tui_*_e2e`, plus the new ACC-SAFE and ACC-PROC scripts). A manual matrix covers {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal} × {80x24, 40x14, 200x60}, checking: approval safety, paste, resize, cancel, narrow hints and NO_COLOR. Record per-cell verdicts and observed outcomes against the exact installed RC artifact. The release owner has waived screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0; this does not waive manual behavior checks or their evidence records.\n+8. **REQ-QUAL-108. Terminal matrix.** PTY scripted runs in CI (existing `tui_*_e2e`, plus the new ACC-SAFE and ACC-PROC scripts). A manual matrix covers {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal} × {80x24, 40x14, 200x60}, checking: approval safety, paste, resize, cancel, narrow hints and NO_COLOR. Record per-cell verdicts and observed outcomes against the exact installed RC artifact. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](../DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v10-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver); manual behavior checks and their evidence records remain mandatory.\n 9. **REQ-QUAL-109 (RELEASE-REQUIRED).** T3 long tasks: at least 8 tasks × 5 runs, each over 60 steps and with at least 2 compactions. Gates: false-absence = 0, false-presence = 0 (DEC-05 amendment, 2026-10-18), and steering honoured ≥ 95% (eval/README thresholds).\n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -35,3 +35,3 @@\n | 13 | `eval/standalone/plain_proxy.mjs`: a forward proxy to the gateway. It injects the gateway token server-side. It strips `/v1/models` to `{id,object,owned_by}`, returns 404 for `/v1/tokenize`, and drops `X-AIHost-*` and admission headers. The `--emulate {llamacpp,vllm,ollama}` profiles add that server's `/models`, `/props`, `/api/show` and overflow-error shapes, derived from the real gateway limits. Unit-tested against a mock gateway. | new `eval/standalone/` | — |\n-| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3. Archive screenshots. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3 | RC build |\n+| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Run the full checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3 and record all per-cell outcomes and evidence. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per DEC-18. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3; DEC-18 | RC build |\n \n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -240,2 +240,10 @@\n \n+## DEC-18: v1.0.0 terminal screenshot-artifact waiver\n+\n+**Context.** The v1.0.0 manual terminal matrix requires real interaction in five terminal environments at three sizes. The release owner waived screenshot artifacts for this release.\n+\n+**Chosen (owner-confirmed 2026-10-28).** Approval-panel and post-exit screenshots are not required for v1.0.0. This waiver changes only the screenshot artifact requirement. It does not waive any interactive run, check, safety threshold, per-cell PASS/FAIL verdict, observed outcome, evidence record, exact installed-RC identity, or written disposition for non-safety failures. All 15 manual matrix cells remain mandatory; automated PTY runs cannot replace them.\n+\n+**Affected:** ACCEPTANCE §5.3 / ACC-TUI-MANUAL; SPEC-10 REQ-QUAL-108; `TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md`; PLAN-10 task 12.\n+\n ## Owner and external actions required (not performed by the audit)\n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -203,3 +203,3 @@\n \n-Record PASS/FAIL per cell and the observed outcomes for each check, bound to the exact installed RC artifact, terminal environment, and size. The release owner has waived screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0; this waiver does not waive any interactive check, safety gate, per-cell verdict, or evidence record.\n+Record PASS/FAIL per cell and the observed outcomes for each check, bound to the exact installed RC artifact, terminal environment, and size. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v10-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver); this does not waive any interactive check, safety gate, per-cell verdict, or evidence record.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793224716397,"completed_at_ms":1793224716402}}
