{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:59:20.627Z","ordinal":466687,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae27035cb6c81a092c1f19a7dcbb349","status":"completed","call_id":"call_933e3f5fd80c49e4847c0d0b83e1f8e9","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md\\n@@\\n-Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v10-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). This does not waive any live manual interaction, check, observation, per-cell verdict, or evidence record. Automated PTY runs do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\\n+Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). This does not waive any live manual interaction, check, observation, per-cell verdict, or evidence record. Automated PTY runs do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\\n@@\\n-| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell has a per-cell verdict and recorded outcomes; the release owner has waived screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0. |\\n+| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell has a per-cell verdict and recorded outcomes; screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per DEC-18. |\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md\\n@@\\n-| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Run the full checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3 and record all per-cell outcomes and evidence. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per DEC-18. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3; DEC-18 | RC build |\\n+| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Run the full checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3 and record all per-cell outcomes and evidence. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](../DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). | ACCEPTANCE §5.3; DEC-18 | RC build |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch))\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","create_time":1793224757.7970939}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:59:20.667Z","ordinal":466688,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-26821d37-c8b6-4721-9038-0d5e3aa90b49","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -120,3 +120,3 @@\n | ACC-QUAL-SMOKE | `make test` includes the T1 self-test and the T4 smoke | Present and passing. |\n-| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell has a per-cell verdict and recorded outcomes; the release owner has waived screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0. |\n+| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | Every cell has a per-cell verdict and recorded outcomes; screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per DEC-18. |\n \n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -35,3 +35,3 @@\n | 13 | `eval/standalone/plain_proxy.mjs`: a forward proxy to the gateway. It injects the gateway token server-side. It strips `/v1/models` to `{id,object,owned_by}`, returns 404 for `/v1/tokenize`, and drops `X-AIHost-*` and admission headers. The `--emulate {llamacpp,vllm,ollama}` profiles add that server's `/models`, `/props`, `/api/show` and overflow-error shapes, derived from the real gateway limits. Unit-tested against a mock gateway. | new `eval/standalone/` | — |\n-| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Run the full checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3 and record all per-cell outcomes and evidence. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per DEC-18. | ACCEPTANCE §5.3; DEC-18 | RC build |\n+| 12 | Terminal matrix (manual): {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal} × 3 sizes. Run the full checklist per ACCEPTANCE §5.3 and record all per-cell outcomes and evidence. Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](../DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). | ACCEPTANCE §5.3; DEC-18 | RC build |\n \n","move_path":null},"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -40,3 +40,3 @@\n \n-Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v10-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). This does not waive any live manual interaction, check, observation, per-cell verdict, or evidence record. Automated PTY runs do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\n+Screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). This does not waive any live manual interaction, check, observation, per-cell verdict, or evidence record. Automated PTY runs do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028/docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793224760664,"completed_at_ms":1793224760667}}
