{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T21:59:58.592Z","ordinal":466713,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-645f9bf9-819f-4b51-bba4-f5cb44cab0b5","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Owner-recorded authenticated read-only query on ubuntu-desktop at 21:48 found trail23 open while Nexus Code change marked merged; finding/approvals commands returned no open change, historical finding disposition unavailable. READINESS correctly says unresolved/unverified; no evidence of resolution. No independent query repeated by this session., current_main_ci=COMPLETED SUCCESS on exact main SHA 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Node22 and Node24 test-matrix passed; CodeQL passed. Linux job 123115317509 passed cargo deny, sync-version, npm ci/build, clean dist, cargo tests, release build, full CLI npm test, security_gates, requirements, two package-linux builds with byte-identical tarball/SHA256SUMS/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES/SBOM/install.sh, CycloneDX validation, smoke-package, installer-smoke; completed 2026-10-28 21:58:49Z. This qualifies exact source/build gates only; package version remains rc.10 and no exact-RC acceptance is implied., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=PR #310 exact pushed head 5afbae0e93de7a87a63cb69c2042315ea4d8bb43 (base 10c84df). Fresh cumulative independent review ACCEPT; diff SHA256 d60c5ec95dc20b642ff89777ecb520cb04f907459105dc41aef9975c20608913. Reviewer confirmed 21:51 CI facts, screenshot waiver limited to screenshots, trail finding remains unresolved/unverified, no release acceptance claim. Exact-head CI is running on this head (Node22/24/JS-TS/Entire at last poll); branch protection requires Node22, Node24, Linux., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or public stable v1.0.0., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Still held by kimi-main. Latest observed scope updated package and installer smoke with isolated HOME and mock inference only. Do not run tests., review_policy=User confirms repository has one human user; do not require another human account. Distinct non-implementing agent review is available and has accepted the documentation changes. Keep formal release acceptance IN_PROGRESS until all mandatory external qualification and exact-RC gates are complete., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=At 2026-10-28 ~21:47 UTC exact PR head b9a23d51622d224d5c7effac8aaef811df3f0cbc: Node22 and Node24 full npm CLI test suites still IN_PROGRESS; JS/TS and CodeQL SUCCESS; Entire Gates IN_PROGRESS; CodeRabbit SUCCESS. PR open, merge state BLOCKED., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., updated 1 minute ago\n  - [done] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=PR #308 merged 2026-10-28T21:15:37Z as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Exact PR head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8 had Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL success; Entire Gates neutral. Main exact-head CI/CodeQL now running as 40770466028 / 40770465935.), updated 43 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md and confirmed RC10 E5 OpenRouter small live task PASS on exact signed RC10 artifact (16ee8ca36438; published archive SHA-256 444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7). Synthetic JS slug task had 7 provider requests; declared verifier passed and independent validation passed added Unicode/emoji/whitespace assertions. README records earlier failed attempts separately and explicitly limits the pass to one small task. It points to RC10 provider verification receipts dated 2026-10-27; no redundant live inference run performed.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 exact head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 independently ACCEPTed; five evidence checksums verified. Required Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL passed. Merged at 2026-10-28T20:36:21Z as b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af. Main CI run 40764779353 is in progress. RC10-only historical evidence.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=Updated docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md in claimed PR #300 worktree at local commit 29ce2978d69554a50b52a0dba9783c986d2d61a1. Observation time 2026-10-28 20:52 UTC; exact main b3dea1a; main Node22/24 still in progress; PR308 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress; PR300 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress. Independent review ACCEPT exact diff SHA-256 f2b2c2b9d4b28d69bcccba3f764f60ff99e2632a83cb303b2a944b6dce408705. `git diff --check` passed. No tests run for docs-only change; no push per repo owner boundary. PR branch requires reconcile with latest main and exact-head checks before integration.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile exact requirements gate on current main (details=Verified on detached clean worktree at exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0 using isolated HOME: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce exits 0; 123 rows, tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7. Deferred to exact-RC qualification: AGT-002, AGT-010, PRV-003, REL-003, REL-005, AGT-110, PRV-111, REL-114, QUAL-101, QUAL-107, QUAL-108, QUAL-109. This is a source gate only, not acceptance.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Confirm Nexus runtime identity defect remediation (details=Independent read-only review ACCEPT for PR #273 exact head 674e5bf37b74ebfe3f41a4390a8735b6f6f23abd, merged as e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2; diff SHA-256 ce628b0b1815e9a57fb3d5e6fa760e3eb7d2bb87bfa86247caad9621781f1876. Prompt-level instructions and activated-skill host tag are covered with Claude-named model/skill regression. Review notes live model compliance and successor-RC behavior remain unverified. Exact PR checks had passed per GitHub; no reviewer suite run.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile user-requested operation maintainability and quality scope (details=Verified on exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: capability definitions split into category files (PR286); convergence scheduler extracted (PR285); runner split across revalidation/execution/persistence