able; don't repair/install it without authorization., release_state=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS. No accepted successor RC or stable v1.0.0. Latest public candidate RC10; installed-RC provider/held-out/cross-runner/manual terminal evidence remains incomplete., terminal_setup=Ubuntu desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable over SSH. GUI session active. xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1 installed. RC10 binary at ~/.local/nexus-rc10-qualification/bin/nexus reports 1.0.0-rc.10 (16ee8ca36438). Opened xterm 80x24 using a disposable workspace as setup only; no manual acceptance evidence collected., review_state=Independent ACCEPT of f8f6983 vs 934ed912, exact diff SHA-256 38425b0e892f4a0741601516b23ca71a768dc4f08ef06955e6f5869ef47d8527, findings 0, tests not run. Review specifically covers staged deletion in assertGitChangesSafe and safe cleanup ordering. A newer uncommitted 10/-2 checkpoint.ts delta was excluded., ci_state=PR308 head 87b560c7: runs 40735401162 and 40735870389 Node22/24 FAILED; Linux skipped; Entire failed due no approvals, failed CI, and one unresolved high finding. PR305 head fde0b7b9 and PR300 head 2b6490f7: Node22/24 PASS; Linux and Entire gates still in progress. Exact main 8580c821 CI and CodeQL now both pass., next_checkpoint2=No tests until SUITE handoff from kimi-main., entire_auth=entire status --json: enabled; five sessions, one active Codex. brain recall effective_engine=bm25_lexical; brain status semantic freshness degraded. entire auth status logged_in=false. Do not attempt installation/config repair; human approval session remains external., suite_claim=codex-root owns SUITE since 2026-10-28 17:46:37Z on v1/checkpoint-ordinary-child-fix, head 1482d6b315129cd46fac61242c2eb91793ed8fd2; focused checkpoint restore validation on immutable snapshot /var/tmp/nexus-pr302-validation-finalfocus-174628, isolated HOME, no inference. No coordinator test execution., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or stable rele