es 40 cli/src or core/src paths. RC10 cannot serve as exact candidate for current source. Ubuntu desktop was freshly reachable at 10.0.8.3; xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, GNOME Terminal and RC10 are installed. Do not count terminal cells until a candidate built from the final source revision is installed.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [done] Monitor post-PR-308 main CI and refresh release readiness (details=Exact main SHA 10c84df run 40770466028 completed SUCCESS, including Node 22/24 tests, Rust and CLI tests, security gates, reproducible package, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke. CodeQL 40770465935 passed. See recovery CI log event at 22:00 UTC.), updated 1 minute ago\\n  - [doing] Post-308 readiness checkpoint PR (details=Remote PR #310 exact head 5afbae0e93de7a87a63cb69c2042315ea4d8bb43/base 10c84df is independent ACCEPT; reviewer /root/rc1_docs_review exact patch SHA256 e26884593defa7f97c96e34f4895636ce2de6496c923adb90b43cb7181cb16bf. It preserves the Entire trail23 finding as unresolved/unverified; the authenticated ubuntu-desktop query itself remains owner-reported, not independently reproduced. PR exact CI remains in progress, auto-merge enabled. Main run 40770466028 on 10c84df: Node22/24 and Linux npm test passed; Linux package build in progress, CodeQL pass. No tests run for docs.), updated 5 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Respect screenshot-artifact waiver; continue terminal behavior qualification (details=User explicitly waived terminal screenshot artifacts for release. This waives screenshots only; live terminal behavior checks and evidence recording remain required. User reported render behavior across tested sizes, with tmux inside GNOME Terminal at 43x13 as the known exception; evaluate whether that human report can satisfy any matrix cells, and do remaining cells on exact successor RC. Current successor RC not built/installed; do not count RC10.), updated 27 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Align acceptance documentation with terminal screenshot-artifact waiver (details=Local commit b035e716657e467c71a2b1a3ef7981068dea0f0c updates ACCEPTANCE.md + SPEC-10. Independent read-only review ACCEPT by /root/rc5_candidate_review; exact patch SHA-256 2ae9a0d6d0ccd661fbb74378ed5ad1297fd26b6c44f927167c19e142eba1e87e; no tests run (docs-only), diff checks pass. All seven manual interactions, zero-failure safety gate for checks 2/5/6, exact-RC/terminal/size binding, per-cell verdict and observations remain…4098 tokens truncated…ver\\n+\\n+**Context.** The v1.0.0 manual terminal matrix requires real interaction in five terminal environments at three sizes. The release owner waived screenshot artifacts for this release.\\n+\\n+**Chosen (owner-confirmed 2026-10-28).** Approval-panel and post-exit screenshots are not required for v1.0.0. This waiver changes only the screenshot artifact requirement. It does not waive any interactive run, check, safety threshold, per-cell PASS/FAIL verdict, observed outcome, evidence record, exact installed-RC identity, or written disposition for non-safety failures. All 15 manual matrix cells remain mandatory; automated PTY runs cannot replace them.\\n+\\n+**Affected:** ACCEPTANCE §5.3 / ACC-TUI-MANUAL; SPEC-10 REQ-QUAL-108; `TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md`; PLAN-10 task 12.\\n+\\n ## Owner and external actions required (not performed by the audit)\\n \\n | # | Action | Why | When |\\ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\nindex 111e2897..94443140 100644\\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@ -1,12 +1,12 @@\\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n \\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 21:51 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 21:58 UTC)\\n \\n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, the PR #308 merge commit. Post-merge CI run [40770466028](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40770466028) remains in progre