26-10-18), and steering honoured ≥ 95% (eval/README thresholds).\n 10. **REQ-QUAL-110 (RELEASE-REQUIRED).** A T4 smoke (scripted model, 2 fault cases) and the T1 self-test run in `make test`.\n \n\n--- claims ---\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_ACCEPTANCE.md/owner.json: {\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/readiness-post-308-merge-20261028\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\",\n  \"base\": \"10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-28T21:40:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Apply user-authorized waiver of manual terminal screenshot artifacts while preserving all terminal behavior and per-cell verdict requirements\",\n  \"status\": \"Local commit b035e716657e467c71a2b1a3ef7981068dea0f0c aligns ACC-TUI-MANUAL with the user-authorized screenshot-artifact waiver; all interactive checks and per-cell outcomes remain required. Awaiting owner push and exact review/checks. Independent read-only review ACCEPT exact patch SHA256 2ae9a0d6d0ccd661fbb74378ed5ad1297fd26b6c44f927167c19e142eba1e87e; no tests run (documentation-only). Local commit remains unpushed; owner push and exact-head CI/integration pending.\",\n  \"head\": \"bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473\",\n  \"independent_review\": {\n    \"disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"reviewer\": \"/root/rc5_candidate_review\",\n    \"commit\": \"b035e716657e467c71a2b1a3ef7981068dea0f0c\",\n    \"patch_sha256\": \"2ae9a0d6d0ccd661fbb74378ed5ad1297fd26b6c44f927167c19e142eba1e87e\",\n    \"findings\": [],\n    \"tests_run\": false,\n    \"confirmed_at\": \"2026-10-28T21:37:00Z\"\n  }\n}\n\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_DECISIONS.md/owner.json: {\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/readiness-post-308-merge-20261028\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc-readiness-correction-20261028\",\n  \"base\": \"10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f9752