as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Exact PR head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8 had Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL success; Entire Gates neutral. Main exact-head CI/CodeQL now running as 40770466028 / 40770465935.), updated 44 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md and confirmed RC10 E5 OpenRouter small live task PASS on exact signed RC10 artifact (16ee8ca36438; published archive SHA-256 444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7). Synthetic JS slug task had 7 provider requests; declared verifier passed and independent validation passed added Unicode/emoji/whitespace assertions. README records earlier failed attempts separately and explicitly limits the pass to one small task. It points to RC10 provider verification receipts dated 2026-10-27; no redundant live inference run performed.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 exact head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 independently ACCEPTed; five evidence checksums verified. Required Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL passed. Merged at 2026-10-28T20:36:21Z as b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af. Main CI run 40764779353 is in progress. RC10-only historical evidence.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=Updated docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md in claimed PR #300 worktree at local commit 29ce2978d69554a50b52a0dba9783c986d2d61a1. Observation time 2026-10-28 20:52 UTC; exact main b3dea1a; main Node22/24 still in progress; PR308 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress; PR300 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress. Independent review ACCEPT exact diff SHA-256 f2b2c2b9d4b28d69bcccba3f764f60ff99e2632a83cb303b2a944b6dce408705. `git diff --check` passed. No tests run for docs-only change; no push per repo owner boundary. PR branch requires reconcile with latest main and exact-head checks before integration.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile exact requirements gate on current main (details=Verified on detached clean worktree at exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0 using isolated HOME: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce exits 0; 123 rows, tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7. Deferred to exact-RC qualification: AGT-002, AGT-010, PRV-003, REL-003, REL-005, AGT-110, PRV-111, REL-114, QUAL-101, QUAL-107, QUAL-108, QUAL-109. This is a source gate only, not acceptance.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Confirm Nexus runtime identity defect remediation (details=Independent read-only review ACCEPT for PR #273 exact head 674e5bf37b74ebfe3f41a4390a8735b6f6f23abd, merged as e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2; diff SHA-256 ce628b0b1815e9a57fb3d5e6fa760e3eb7d2bb87bfa86247caad9621781f1876. Prompt-level instructions and activated-skill host tag are covered with Claude-named model/skill regression. Review notes live model compliance and successor-RC behavior remain unverified. Exact PR checks had passed per GitHub; no reviewer suite run.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile user-requested operation maintainability and quality scope (details=Verified on exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: capability definitions split into category files (PR286); convergence scheduler extracted (PR285); runner split across revalidation/execution/persistence (PR287); operator config via ~/.config/nexus/config.json (PR289); DecisionRejected behavior and recovery documented (PR293); runtime diagnostic handling fixed/tested (PR296). Current files are ~10 KB capabilities, ~16 KB operation model, ~24 KB scheduler, ~22 KB runner. Generated DAG invariant tests explore 100 fixed seeds; real-agent lifecycle integration tests exist. No remaining empty catch blocks in the operation runner modules. These are source-level observations; current main CI/full-suite results still pending.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [doing] Close evaluation coverage gate with independent held-out qualification (details=Fresh Issue #1 check at 2026-10-28 20:24 UTC still OPEN/unassigned; no response to prior metadata-only request at 14:23. Sent a concise follow-up asking whether the independent author/custodian is active, for the next checkpoint, or for the authorized custody handoff path. Comment 6479873007; no payloads/answers/private digests requested. Public 40-task manifest is not custody acceptance; compatibility blocker remains legacy hidden command format vs blackbox-v1 evaluator. Qualification remains unstarted and protected.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Refresh authoritative release state after Entire review (details=Current authoritative state refreshed 2026-10-28 20:06 UTC. origin/main=13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0; its CI run 40751988282 passed all required jobs. PR300 head f3957a67 and PR309 head aace981b are based on current main with Node22/24 still in progress at last check. PR308 head 2c1b2dfa remains on current base, Node24 succeeded, Node22 still running in run 40757432379. Main rules require Node22, Node24, Linux only and zero approving reviews; Entire Gates (including approval/finding signal) is not a required status check and must not be treated as a human reviewer blocker. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Verify Nexus host identity is independent of provider/model (details=Confirmed on exact current origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: cli/src/agent.ts:232 injects explicit Nexus Code host identity and prohibits inferring host from provider/model; cli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts covers it. Exact-main CI 40751988282 passed Node22, Node24 and Linux. This is source/CI evidence, not exact-RC qualification.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Verify sensitive-checkpoint failure offers operator choices (details=Confirmed on exact current origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0: REPL offers read-only, continue without rollback checkpoint, create checkpoint despite sensitive persistence risk, cancel, or re-enter; sidecar reports same options. Tests cover REPL and sidecar; exact-main CI 40751988282 passed all jobs. This is source/CI evidence, not exact-RC qualification.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [done] Verify upgrade accepts signed GitHub release asset redirect (details=The RC7 failure URL host is now explicitly allowlisted in current origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0 only for the expected release-asset path (cli/src/upgrade.ts:665-671). cli/test/upgrade_safety.test.ts:159 covers a synthetic signed GitHub release URL and unsafe cases remain rejected. Exact-main CI run 40751988282 passed all three jobs. This source check does not replace running `nexus upgrade` on the successor exact RC/package or validate backup-time UX.), updated about 2 hours ago\n  - [doing] Reconcile doctor D1-D3 report against current main (details=Entire recall plus exact committed origin/main source/test inspection at 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0. D1 appears source-remediated: async opendir/lstat in batches of 128, bounded newest-record parsing, 30s default integrity deadline; committed tests assert event-loop responsiveness, bounded concurrency and deadline. D2 appears source-remediated: index.json is excluded, schema-v2 requires messageLog and rejects message