{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:08:25.192Z","ordinal":467103,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae27258700481a083d7580993944a7e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The fresh independent review found a real issue in the candidate: a mid-read I/O error can be turned into a successful partial batch result. That candidate cannot advance as-is. I’m checking ownership of the affected source and test files, then I’ll fix the error propagation and add regression coverage without starting another suite while PR #310’s full CI is running."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793225304471,"completed_at_ms":1793225305192}}
