{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:17:24.404Z","ordinal":467461,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-da7a72a1-16f6-4f4c-9048-0c38f4268714","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Owner-recorded authenticated read-only query on ubuntu-desktop at 21:48 found trail23 open while Nexus Code change marked merged; finding/approvals commands returned no open change, historical finding disposition unavailable. READINESS correctly says unresolved/unverified; no evidence of resolution. No independent query repeated by this session., current_main_ci=All checks now COMPLETED SUCCESS on exact SHA 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Node22/24 and CodeQL passed; Linux-x86_64 completed 21:58:53Z after passing full CLI suite, security/requirements checks, deterministic double package build (archive, checksums, notices, SBOM, installer identical), SBOM validation, package smoke and installer smoke. Package produced was still v1.0.0-rc.10, so this is source/build-gate evidence, not successor-RC qualification., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=At 2026-10-28 22:12Z, remote PR #310 head remains 1f54f2f7835e05b8470cb68156ec96362e99d8c7 on base 10c84df. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates in progress but neutral/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or public stable v1.0.0., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Still held by kimi-main. Latest observed scope updated package and installer smoke with isolated HOME and mock inference only. Do not run tests., review_policy=User confirms repository has one human user; do not require another human account. Distinct non-implementing agent review is available and has accepted the documentation changes. Keep formal release acceptance IN_PROGRESS until all mandatory external qualification and exact-RC gates are complete., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=At 2026-10-28 ~21:47 UTC exact PR head b9a23d51622d224d5c7effac8aaef811df3f0cbc: Node22 and Node24 full npm CLI test suites still IN_PROGRESS; JS/TS and CodeQL SUCCESS; Entire Gates IN_PROGRESS; CodeRabbit SUCCESS. PR open, merge state BLOCKED., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., rc_process=Verified from `.github/workflows/release.yml` and `scripts/sync-version.mjs` at exact current source 10c84df: root package.json is version source; sync-version updates CLI and Rust package/lock files. Tag workflow requires tag on main, tag/version match, and docs/releases/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., updated 5 minutes ago\n  - [done] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=PR #308 merged 2026-10-28T21:15:37Z as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Exact PR head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8 had Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL success; Entire Gates neutral. Main exact-head CI/CodeQL now running as 40770466028 / 40770465935.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated about 1 hour ago\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence do