l/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or public stable v1.0.0., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Still held by kimi-main. Latest observed scope updated package and installer smoke with isolated HOME and mock inference only. Do not run tests., review_policy=User confirms repository has one human user; do not require another human account. Distinct non-implementing agent review is available and has accepted the documentation changes. Keep formal release acceptance IN_PROGRESS until all mandatory external qualification and exact-RC gates are complete., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms sam