/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., updated 5 minutes ago\\n  - [done] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=PR #308 merged 2026-10-28T21:15:37Z as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Exact PR head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8 had Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL success; Entire Gates neutral. Main exact-head CI/CodeQL now running as 40770466028 / 40770465935.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md and confirmed RC10 E5 OpenRouter