{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:19:09.952Z","ordinal":467521,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-48a8461e-1252-4b7e-bacc-83296cf81c0d","process_id":"4167","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n -C 4 \"1934|1937|capped fixture|missing capped|capped.*fixture\" /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/.git 2>/dev/null | head -140"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rg -n -C 4 \"1934|1937|capped fixture|missing capped|capped.*fixture\" /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/.git 2>/dev/null | head -140"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-43-## Superseded checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 13:34:51 UTC)\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-44-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-45-**Authoritative source:** `origin/main` is `b2ae2fe82640e44d58ef5418f49b46df03392212`, the PR #304 merge. Main CI [40693030763](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40693030763) has Node 22 and Node 24 matrix jobs passed (13:23:35 and 13:23:05 UTC); Linux x86_64 remains in progress. CodeQL [40693030710](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40693030710) passed at 13:07:03 UTC. On a clean detached worktree at this exact head, `HOME=/tmp/nexus-req-home XDG_CONFIG_HOME=/tmp/nexus-req-xdg node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 requirements; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 requirements deferred to exact-RC qualification. PR #304 adds opt-in v1.1 Git-aware operations to current main; its exact-head CI and CodeQL passed and Entire Gates concluded neutral. The independent review recorded an unresolved correctness defect: an explicit restart recreates a clean worktree while resuming the old agent conversation. That behavior must be fixed and requalified before an RC built from this main can be accepted.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-46-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:47:**Source PRs:** PR [#303](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/303) is integrated at `4cac22d`; its exact-head required CI and independent review passed. PR [#304](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/304) is integrated at `b2ae2fe`; its exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, CodeQL and JS/TS checks passed and Entire Gates concluded neutral. Its independent review nevertheless found the restart/conversation defect above. PR [#305](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/305) addresses that defect at `f7e573ec8de98fb3ec24a96e148a84b4ccab151f`, with independent review ACCEPT at diff SHA-256 `cf1abd6ce5e7083aebe526efaaee85380dee295fced7814a7ddedcd609a11615`. Build and focused test TypeScript check passed; the runtime test was not run locally because `SUITE` is claimed by `kimi-main`. Exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 jobs in run `40694815985` both failed with 1,882 passed, 2 failed and 2 skipped: `durable_continuity.test.ts` expected the explicit-restart recovery warning, and `tdd_work_units.test.ts` uses a fake agent without `restartConversation`. JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed; Linux was skipped after the matrix failures, and Entire Gates remain pending. PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) is at `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f` on base `b2ae2fe`; independent review ACCEPTed this exact head at diff SHA-256 `55afcdc8ed8044bb0aa0a54932c5ba6513763b564bc8fb76014b3334db33ae38`. Its Node 22/24 jobs are in progress, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, and Entire Gates are pending. Issue [#298](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/298) remains open until its fix is integrated and current-main checks pass. At the 13:34:51 UTC snapshot cutoff, before the readiness-only correction was pushed, PR [#300](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300) was at `e1974fd82dba1aba8e5e2e5b1bc9cf964fe6db20` on base `b2ae2fe`; Node 22/24 and Entire were in progress, while JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. The subsequent documentation-only update restarted exact-head checks; the claim record tracks its latest head and current statuses. The independent factual review found stale status/head references in the prior checkpoint; corrected evidence is pending re-review. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) is at `659d6a63a8708ebe98240ec1937b0f2acdcdfac4` on base `b2ae2fe`; Node 22/24, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed, while Linux x86_64 (run `40693955666`) is in progress and Entire Gates are pending. Independent read-only review ACCEPTed the final cumulative diff `1099e6ff6b68ab9907ac66c908bf45c8ab1af338d3b6a14227d45d60cf35dc29`; no tests were run as part of review. Exact-head CI is still pending.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-48-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-49-**Requested codebase-review findings:** The prior checkpoint's implementation and evidence summary remains applicable; the current main includes the capability-category split, scheduler extraction, operation-runner decomposition, bounded diagnostics, `DecisionRejected` guidance, lifecycle tests, and 100 fixed-seed scheduler invariants. The operator config remains intentionally limited to `operationPolicy`; general runtime-default customization is not claimed.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-50-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-51-**Runtime identity dogfooding defect:** The user-reported RC8 behavior in which a Claude-specific skill led the model to describe Nexus as Claude Code has a source fix in merged PR [#273](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/273), integrated at `d97ccb70c87db096c75e1bd4ff58dbcdf0aa8ab1` (PR merge commit `e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2`). The fixed system prompt states Nexus Code is the host and is appended after workspace skills; activated skills are also prefaced with `Host application: Nexus Code`. `cli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts` reproduces a Claude model plus Claude-specific skill and verifies both boundaries. That test passed 1/1 in an isolated exact-main `b293b44` snapshot; PR #273's Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed, and exact-main CI also passed. The public RC10 tag (`16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`) predates the PR merge, so this fix still needs verification in the successor RC.\n--\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-160-**Authoritative source and post-merge CI:** `origin/main` is `1d9357ee63b1066a891584a898842814de614fbf`, integrating PR [#264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264). Its exact-head CI [40499840211](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499840211) and CodeQL [40499839711](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40499839711) passed before merge. Post-merge CodeQL [40505388849](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388849) passed on `1d9357e`; post-merge CI [40505388775](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40505388775) is still running both Node 22 and Node 24 CLI suites. No result is inferred before they finish.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-161-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-162-**Readiness PR and local full-suite result:** PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) remains remotely at `bda6714ff885f2fd4fef736b84ca7005a9cddbdf`, based on `303ea322a7148b4a9d1a8231d7ce1c8f824bbae4`; it is conflicting with current `main` and its old successful checks are stale. The claimed local branch had been refreshed through `bff9f13085368e6cc269b1bb294db5b3b810bd7a`; the updated branch now incorporates `1d9357e` and is awaiting final independent review. No push or merge is claimed.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-163-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:164:An isolated immutable snapshot at `9344df578f8a39a55d82ead0f15c4811864d21f8` built successfully, but `make test` exited 2: 1,769 passed, 2 failed, and 1 was skipped. `eval_integrity.test.ts` observed three OOM kills during this host run, which did not have the dedicated capped workspace mount; the log does not establish that the missing mount caused those kills. `eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts` failed its precondition because `NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT` and `NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT` were not configured. `/tmp`, `/var/tmp`, and `/home` were all on the same ext4 device. These are incomplete host-fixture checks, not a passing suite or a demonstrated source regression. The complete output is retained at `/var/tmp/nexus-pr268-make-test-9344df5.log`. Current exact-main hosted CI is still running the full CLI suite with its configured cgroups and capped tmpfs.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-165-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-166-**Release and acceptance gates:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) remains a prerelease; stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. The human real-terminal matrix remains 0/15; the user's report of rendering at 43×13 in tmux on GNOME Terminal is not the full matrix and had no captured screenshots. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN, last updated 2026-10-26 17:37:53 UTC, with no recorded custodian acceptance. T2/T3/T4, live provider/standalone, independent exact-RC, and human acceptance gates remain incomplete. Publication authorization remains gated on all required acceptance.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-167-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-168-The 12:42 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence and superseded for current branch, CI, and test status by this checkpoint.\n--\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-541-This checkpoint reconciles the candidate ledger and acceptance procedure against recorded source and test evidence. It is not a release approval. Historical inspection sections below are preserved as audit evidence and do not represent current branch state where superseded by the 2026-10-21 update.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-542-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-543-## Current state update (2026-10-21 14:56 UTC, `8f4504e`)\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-544-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:545:- **Authoritative integration and source CI:** `origin/v1/integration` is `8f4504ebd3484149bde39b78934c193752a95bfd`, including the PR #101 restore-safety follow-up. PR #101 exact-head CI run [39604909967](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39604909967) passed Node 20/22/24 and Linux packaging; CodeQL [39604909977](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39604909977) passed. Post-merge PR CI [39610114264](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39610114264) passed, but checked out synthetic merge commit `5955b5e` (`8f4504e` merged with `db1ca55`). The separately dispatched source workflow [39615105190](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39615105190) passed all jobs on exact `v1/integration` SHA `8f4504e`; post-merge CodeQL runs [39610114305](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39610114305) and [39610102703](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39610102703) passed on that SHA.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-546-- **PR and contest state:** PR #8 remains a draft integration-to-`main` candidate. Its CI and CodeQL checks are green, but it is not a release acceptance or publication. PR #102 is open at `3756afe05dbd75c4e6929d87cd50facbb8ab1748`, based on `8f4504e`, to record a synthetic qualification-host preflight; its CodeQL and TypeScript checks passed and its Node matrix was still running at this checkpoint. The preflight report records 10/10 checks using only an empty synthetic marker store; it does not establish private corpus custody or qualification acceptance. The contest has concluded; no contest freeze applies. Historical contest artifacts remain historical evidence only.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-547-- **Requirements enforcement:** `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed on exact source tree `8f4504e` (tree `2a0799c8a32e88e34322b712cf937d73cbe4d637`), with isolated `HOME`/XDG: 123 rows (109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open). Eleven rows remain below the ordinary tested threshold pending their approved exact-RC evidence: `REQ-AGT-002`, `REQ-AGT-010`, `REQ-PRV-003`, `REQ-REL-005`, `REQ-AGT-110`, `REQ-PRV-111`, `REQ-REL-114`, `REQ-QUAL-101`, `REQ-QUAL-107`, `REQ-QUAL-108`, and `REQ-QUAL-109`. The pre-RC checker pass does not imply those RC gates have passed or authorize an acceptance claim.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-548-- **Evaluator and qualification-host boundary:** Source fixtures for cgroup resource limits, process-tree cleanup, workspace storage, and staged Git-history isolation are in the integration source suite and passed its exact-source CI. A synthetic host preflight at source `8f4504e` recorded 10/10 checks and is being documented in PR #102. Neither source fixtures nor the synthetic-host report establish access separation against the custodian's real store or permit held-out execution before custody acceptance.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-549-- **Held-out corpus and custody:** Public T2 manifest `eval/heldout-manifest.json` remains the 40-task identity `50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b`; T3 public manifest identity remains `85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4bfa0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383`. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) has no custodian response since 2026-10-21 12:21 UTC. Current evaluator qualification rejects the sealed T2 corpus's legacy `hidden.command` format; the documented path requires a custodian-owned compatible immutable successor and repeated custody checks. Private digest re-derivation, exposure history, setup/reference validation, effective access separation, and current custody acceptance remain unverified here. No payload, validator, reference solution, or hidden answer was accessed, and no held-out run has started.\n--\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-715-- **PR #216:** merged to that source revision after exact-head checks and independent source review. The unrelated shared checkout remains dirty and was not used or modified for this checkpoint.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-716-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-717-### RC5 artifacts and installation\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-718-\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:719:- Release workflow [40193772994](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40193772994) completed successfully and published `v1.0.0-rc.5` as a prerelease. The archive SHA-256 is `b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`; `SHA256SUMS` SHA-256 is `2206b35a0aed8a4b9635012c0ad55a6eae34d12fe3255c53d43ab8b1d8e7a8c1`.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-720-- Published asset hashes and provenance attestations verified against the release workflow and exact tag. The official installer installed the archive on the authenticated engineering host; its version, package manifest and provenance sidecar matched the candidate.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-721-- E2 is **partial**: all eight fresh-install/minimum-runtime cells and eight expected negative preflight cells passed across the prepared Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Debian 12 and Fedora 40 images. One Ubuntu 22.04 / Node 22 lifecycle cell passed alpha.2 upgrade, repair, rollback and uninstall. The remaining lifecycle cases are not complete. Current-source evaluator host preflight passed 10/10 using synthetic markers only; this is not held-out custody or qualification evidence.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-722-- Ubuntu/GNOME is reachable and has all five required terminal applications, but `gh auth status` there reports no GitHub login. The RC5 installer stopped before creating files; the version-scoped desktop install prefix is absent. The manual terminal matrix is **0/15**.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md-723-\n--\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS-40-1f6979b33e298e76d29180fbc162b7748949459bf91b76913218eb0d4609d7eb  evidence/D_pty/s6_steer_cancel.py\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS-41-89274f9456aca7cee471852fa0778cf96916604dfde3e85aaa575076093f0008  evidence/D_pty/s6n.notes.txt\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS-42-0522f799ec4cad90bfc15132bfcce5f0c9d15f2ce264da5b5120414317391ead  evidence/D_pty/s6n.py\n/ho