{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:20:32.184Z","ordinal":467557,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1847a-3716-77f0-9e7d-01ae06afc407","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae2752f0b4c81a091c104f94f009555","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood. I won’t require another human GitHub account; a distinct, non-implementing agent can review changes independently. That review is not overall release acceptance.\n\nPR #310’s Node 22 and Node 24 test jobs are still running on exact head `1f54f2f`. The candidate’s batch-read error fix at `4c4df05` has an accepted independent review and its focused regression test passed. I’m holding off on starting another full suite until PR #310’s jobs finish.\n\n**Campaign status: `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; no accepted RC or completed release is claimed.**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793226031095,"completed_at_ms":1793226032184}}
