provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:383:**RC7 qualification evidence:** Signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` remains the latest published candidate, resolving to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; its Linux archive digest remains `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. Cross-runner reproducibility passed for RC7 only (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)); ChatGPT provider verification passed 3/3 on the installed RC7 using `gpt-6-luna`. A fresh provider-status check on the Ubuntu desktop at 01:54 UTC found ChatGPT connected and OpenRouter disconnected. RC7 evidence does not qualify a later candidate or establish acceptance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:405:**Exact `main` source gates:** Current `origin/main` is `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`. Post-merge CodeQL run [40243331241](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331241) passed on this exact SHA. Post-merge CI run [40243331324](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331324) completed successfully on this exact SHA: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility, SBOM, smoke, and installer checks passed. At this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in a detached worktree with isolated HOME/XDG: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source gates do not constitute installed-RC acceptance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:415:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `1f3c655971ade086f55347926db16cf2ecd52d1f`, merging PR #161's pinned Linux builder/reproducibility changes. Exact-main CI [39957281380](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39957281380) completed successfully: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 jobs all passed, including the full