{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:22:38.223Z","ordinal":467613,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae275ad746481a085e9af5b1a797d3f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The independent corpus-status audit found a concrete evaluator compatibility issue beyond the custodian delay: the sealed public T2 corpus still uses legacy hidden commands that current qualification rejects. I’m checking the accepted evaluator contract and active file claims now; I’ll work on synthetic compatibility coverage only and keep private corpus material out of scope."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793226157524,"completed_at_ms":1793226158223}}
