{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:25:59.985Z","ordinal":467735,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae276766f6881a0b9d2d417d9fde176","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m continuing without requiring a second human reviewer. The source change has an independent agent review, and release acceptance remains separate and `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\n- PR #310’s Node 22 and Node 24 checks passed on exact head `1f54f2f`. Its Linux job passed the Rust tests and build; the full CLI suite is running, with packaging and reproducibility checks still queued.\n- Candidate `4c4df05` passes its focused regression test, independent review, enforced requirements check, and version check. The version is still `1.0.0-rc.10`, so this is not an RC artifact.\n- I posted a metadata-only custodian follow-up on [Issue #1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6482202709). Qualification correctly rejects legacy in-process hidden validators; I’m preserving that security boundary while the custodian conversion or replacement path remains unresolved.\n- No held-out payload was accessed. No RC has been accepted and no stable release is claimed."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793226358461,"completed_at_ms":1793226359985}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:25:59.993Z","ordinal":467736,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae276766f6881a0b9d2d417d9fde176","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I’m continuing without requiring a second human reviewer. The source change has an independent agent review, and release acceptance remains separate and `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\n- PR #310’s Node 22 and Node 24 checks passed on exact head `1f54f2f`. Its Linux job passed the Rust tests and build; the full CLI suite is running, with packaging and reproducibility checks still queued.\n- Candidate `4c4df05` passes its focused regression test, independent review, enforced requirements check, and version check. The version is still `1.0.0-rc.10`, so this is not an RC artifact.\n- I posted a metadata-only custodian follow-up on [Issue #1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6482202709). Qualification correctly rejects legacy in-process hidden validators; I’m preserving that security boundary while the custodian conversion or replacement path remains unresolved.\n- No held-out payload was accessed. No RC has been accepted and no stable release is claimed.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","create_time":1793226358.4373384,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae276766f6881a0b9d2d417d9fde176","turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1849e-c4b8-7ff3-a39b-1207d8b81045","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22250}}
