{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:27:00.059Z","ordinal":467739,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","turn_id":"01a1849a-b358-70f3-86ea-b2ec73ad98ca","last_agent_message":"I’m continuing without requiring a second human reviewer. The source change has an independent agent review, and release acceptance remains separate and `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\n- PR #310’s Node 22 and Node 24 checks passed on exact head `1f54f2f`. Its Linux job passed the Rust tests and build; the full CLI suite is running, with packaging and reproducibility checks still queued.\n- Candidate `4c4df05` passes its focused regression test, independent review, enforced requirements check, and version check. The version is still `1.0.0-rc.10`, so this is not an RC artifact.\n- I posted a metadata-only custodian follow-up on [Issue #1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6482202709). Qualification correctly rejects legacy in-process hidden validators; I’m preserving that security boundary while the custodian conversion or replacement path remains unresolved.\n- No held-out payload was accessed. No RC has been accepted and no stable release is claimed.","started_at":1793226093,"completed_at":1793226420,"duration_ms":326479,"time_to_first_token_ms":4083}}
