e originals, and no action is replayed (cf. the no-replay assertion `compaction_continuity.test.ts:566`). This requires running the suite (SUITE claim) → **deferred to execution; the test specification itself is statically closable now.**\n/tmp/nexus-rc5-prepare/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/INDEP-REVIEW-CONTINUITY/findings-verification.md:157:| M3 | confirmed | ACC-CONT-03 (SPEC-04:146) | Test spec now; execution deferred (SUITE) |\n/tmp/nexus-home.Fzx5ei/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/libgit2-sys-0.18.8+1.9.7/libgit2/.github/workflows/benchmark.yml:95:          SUITE_FLAG=\"--suite ${{ github.event.inputs.suite }}\"\n/tmp/nexus-home.Fzx5ei/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/libgit2-sys-0.18.8+1.9.7/libgit2/.github/workflows/benchmark.yml:104:            ${SUITE_FLAG} ${DEBUG_FLAG} \\\n","exit_code":2,"duration":{"secs":914,"nanos":961900948}},"started_at_ms":1793225855882,"completed_at_ms":1793226770848}}
