d plugins when they fit the task. Proactively search for plugins when an external app, account, or service would material\nmcp__codex_apps__sites_add_custom_domain :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_change_site_slug :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_create_schedule :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_create_site :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_create_source_repository_write_credential :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_deploy_private_site_version :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. \nmcp__codex_apps__sites_deploy_site_version :: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact p