{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:56:14.031Z","ordinal":468564,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae27d8c89f481a0bda59d63b5974c48","status":"completed","call_id":"call_3b0285b77a6546429a812fcaa60f45e0","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"v1.0.0 release\",fields:{\n  terminal_preflight:\"Verified by SSH on 2026-10-28: ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 has xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, VS Code 1.143.1; active local seat0 is Wayland. SSH DISPLAY is unset; no GUI windows were opened and no matrix cell was run. Result appended to nexus-claims.log; screenshot artifacts waived only.\",\n  rc_tags:\"Current remote tags/releases refreshed 2026-10-28: latest published candidate is v1.0.0-rc.10 at tag commit 0e99eeb7268ec798d4859f01279c9db8b1ce42f6, peeled source 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0; no rc.11 or stable v1.0.0 exists. Candidate source version check remains rc.10.\"\n}});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793228172.5418925}}}
