cord exact snapshot SHA plus concurrent-change risk, and do not implement optimization or prove a preferred theory. [Task 1]\\n218:- The requested A-I report was not delivered because the rollout pivoted to `/home/mike/nexus-blockers` remediation review. Do not change repository/task scope without explicit authorization; stop or ask before a new investigation replaces the requested deliverable. [Task 1]\\n220:# Task Group: Nexus live Ratatui TUI review and redaction/observer isolation\\n221:scope: Read-only review of the landed live Ratatui TUI on `/home/mike/nexus-code` `main`; use when reviewing the live sidecar/TUI protocol, evidence and receipt panels, streaming redaction, or observer isolation, not as qualification that the implementation's tests passed.\\n222:applies_to: cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code (rollout metadata recorded cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost); reuse_rule=inspect the current HEAD and preserve any dirty working tree before reviewing; re-run TypeScript, Rust, and PTY coverage before treating this code-review result as release qualification.\\n228:- rollout_summaries/2026-10-03T23-20-44-plr4-review_landed_ratatui_tui_main_2860228.md (cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost; target=/home/mike/nexus-code, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/10/03/rollout-2026-10-03T23-20-44-01a10411-e678-7183-9233-5c0bc13de1ca.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T05:44:28+00:00, thread_id=01a10411-e678-7183-9233-5c0bc13de1ca, read-only review; no tests run)\\n236:- when the user asks to “review the changes” already landed on `main`, inspect the current HEAD rather than rely on stale findings, preserve dirty working-tree changes, and report actionable findings with file/line references. [Task 1]\\n240:- At reviewed HEAD `2860228`, Nexus had moved from a snapshot viewer to a live Ratatui client: multiline composer, approval overlays, slash commands, cancellation, tool-detail/evidence panels, receipt panels, and default TUI launch in a terminal. `--repl` remains the readline fallback. [Task 1]\\n249:- Stop rule: this was code review only; no TypeScript, Rust, or PTY suites ran. Treat qualification as pending until those relevant suites pass. [Task 1]\\n251:# Task Group: Nexus CRED-003 FlightRecorder and audit-log credential sanitization\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793228206.0568333}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
