{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T22:57:40.340Z","ordinal":468626,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b7bd6a1d-0b5e-4bb8-9ffc-b17abc70e8ba","process_id":"35018","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --json state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,assignees,updatedAt,lastComment:(.comments[-1] | {createdAt,author,body})}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --json state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,assignees,updatedAt,lastComment:(.comments[-1] | {createdAt,author,body})}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"lastComment\":{\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"body\":\"Release qualification contract clarification (2026-10-28): the current exact-source evaluator intentionally rejects in-process legacy hidden validators for qualification (`eval/validate.mjs` qualification check and `eval/run.mjs` hidden-check path). The evaluator documentation explains that those validators share the candidate runtime/workspace and are not safe for independent qualification; the qualification format is the isolated `blackbox-v1` oracle. This is a security boundary, so coordinator changes will not enable legacy hidden commands to make the existing corpus run.\\n\\nPlease confirm the custodian-led path to convert the sealed public task manifest to `blackbox-v1` or produce a newly versioned replacement corpus, then perform private validator/reference checks and re-derive custody digests. Public metadata only is needed here: corpus version/manifest identity, compatibility status, owner/checkpoint, and whether this conversion requires new custody acceptance. No private payloads, answers, validators, reference patches, or private digests should be posted. Held-out qualification remains unstarted pending custodian acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T22:23:50Z\"},\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-28T22:23:51Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":566868150}},"started_at_ms":1793228259773,"completed_at_ms":1793228260340}}
