ce\":\"%s\",\"pid\":%s}\\n' \\\n    \"$AGENT_NAME\" \"v1/plan-01-pr-1a\" \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ)\" \"$$\" > \"$CLAIMS/$SLICE/owner.json\"\nelse\n  echo \"claimed by: $(cat \"$CLAIMS/$SLICE/owner.json\")\"; exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n- **Release** the claim by deleting its directory (`rm -r \"$CLAIMS/$SLICE\"`) after the slice merges or is abandoned. Write one line about the outcome to `$CLAIMS/../nexus-claims.log`.\n- **Hot-file claims** use the same mechanism with the name `FILE_<path with / replaced by _>`, for example `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts`. See §4.\n- **Stale claims.** A claim older than 24 h whose PID is gone may be broken, but only by the owner, or by an agent that first records the broken claim in the log.\n- If the MCP Agent Mail server is available, its file reservations (`file_reservation_paths`) may be used as well. The git-common-dir claim stays authoritative, because every agent can see it without extra tooling.\n\n## 3. Isolation: worktree, branch, HOME, ports, processes\n\n\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_tui_surface_e2e.test.ts\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/plan-01-sec101-119-pty-followup\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-25T01:07:59Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"PLAN-01_SEC101_119_PTY_FOLLOWUP_20261025\",\n  \"status\": \"RELEASED with stale PLAN-01_SEC101_119_PTY_REBASE_VALIDATION_20251025 claim; no worktree/branch/live process or retained patch found during recovery audit.\",\n  \"released_at\": \"2026-10-27T23:56Z\"\n}\n cli/src/core/operation_checkpoints.ts       |  80 +++++--\n cli/src/core/operation_git.ts               | 113 +++++++---\n cli/src/core/operation_runner.ts            |  35 ++--\n cli/src/core/state.ts                       |  26 ++-\n cli/src/credentials.ts                      | 120 +++++++----\n cli/src/index.ts                            |  43 ++--\n cli/src/model_catalog.ts                    |   7 +-\n cli/src/operation_cli.ts                    |  57 +++--\n cli/src/provider_cli.ts                     |   3 +-\n cli/src/provider_connect.ts                 |   6 +-\n cli/test/context_management.test.ts         | 162 ++++++++++++++\n cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts             |  10 +-\n cli/test/helpers/tui_pty_driver.py          |   9 +-\n cli/test/operation_account_identity.test.ts |   2 +-\n cli/test/operation_git.test.ts              | 313 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n cli/test/operation_view.test.ts             |  67 ++++++\n cli/test/provider_cli.test.ts               |  33 +++\n cli/test/provider_connect.test.ts           | 100 ++++++++-\n cli/test/state.test.ts                      |  94 ++++++++-\n cli/test/update_plan_turn_result.test.ts    |  46 ++++\n core/src/file_ops.rs                        |  44 +++-\n 21 files changed, 1219 insertions(+), 151 deletions(-)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28023}},"started_at_ms":1793228572315,"completed_at_ms":1793228572315}}
