{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:15:59.012Z","ordinal":469106,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a184cc-87a4-7683-8b81-5a20a928f27e","call_id":"call_d42395cd60284469b9499cbf03b26a5a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"61fb9f\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.000854504,\"session_id\":20343,\"original_token_count\":1308,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 1308)\\nTotal output lines: 62\\n\\n  ✔ the re-run note survives when an oversized re-run is cut to fit the context (5255.270187ms)\\n  ✔ without recorded findings a repeated call carries no notice (4260.950234ms)\\n  ✔ removal notes say what the model had of each observation; the legacy wording is still honoured (405.061958ms)\\n✔ D: findings checkpoint before shown output leaves the context (97576.572222ms)\\n▶ E: an operator-configured verifier gates every completion\\n  ✔ a completion with no changes is refused; a later Markdown write remains regression-only (2451.973293ms)\\n\\n💭 Assistant: I am done.\\n\\n  ✔ a refused completion followed by a plain answer is not established (675.670083ms)\\n\\n💭 Assistant: a.txt is present.\\n\\n  ✔ a turn that ends without the configured verifier passing is not verified: a plain answer, read-only, or dry-run (2339.390761ms)\\n- Working: task_completed\\n✔ Working: task_completed\\n  ✔ a subagent's read-only report is not gated by the parent's configured verifier; the parent's completion is (1675.921387ms)\\n\\n💭 Assistant: a.txt is present.\\n\\n\\n💭 Assistant: a.txt is present.\\n\\n  ✔ a work unit run at depth 1, as the operation runner builds it, is still gated by the configured verifier (562.001301ms)\\n  ✔ a passing gate changes nothing about a read-only outcome: NOT_REQUIRED, or UNVERIFIED when evidence left the context (4868.722779ms)\\n  ✔ without a configured verifier a read-only completion runs no verifier,