grep -m / --max-count, sed -n ranges, sed Nq and awk NR limits are limits too (2.108305ms)\\n  ✔ against this repository: a depth-bounded file_tree count is marked as not the tracked-file count, and a head-limited search as unable to show absence (296.885962ms)\\n✔ G: recorded findings under memory pressure stay distinct, sourced and recoverable; cut-off output cannot show absence (8860.167959ms)\\n▶ CTX-01 residuals\\n  ✔ read_findings says a named finding's text was lost rather than never recorded; a failed mid-turn save is reported once (51.221492ms)\\n✔ CTX-01 residuals (51.50424ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793229359.0122423}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
