frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.925888ms)\\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (3.562725ms)\\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (136.519804ms)\\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.545411ms)\\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (20944.923752ms)\\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2737.377912ms)\\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3511.339004ms)\\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (3462.682727ms)\\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.296317ms)\\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (22.408943ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793229695.5132737}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
