{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:26:36.969Z","ordinal":469234,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a184d6-43a9-7791-be80-ebf6dd52bfa4","call_id":"call_4c1bd276cee44a51bdc24ce8b6f81025","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"ff7c7b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":30.000651791,\"session_id\":20343,\"original_token_count\":7216,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 7216)\\nTotal output lines: 296\\n\\n✔ default operation diagnostics keep machine-readable stdout clean (3.074214ms)\\n✔ operation revalidation logs bounded diagnostics and continues after catalog refresh errors (6.002614ms)\\n✔ malformed operation lock emits a bounded diagnostic before refusing concurrent execution (10.174936ms)\\n✔ explicit operation-unit restart starts a fresh conversation instead of resuming discarded worktree history (9.763657ms)\\n✔ projects units, depth, durable state and the open decision (8.905882ms)\\n✔ reports resource eligibility with the scheduler's own rules (2.068459ms)\\n✔ shows a missing dependency and every unit on a cycle (1.755656ms)\\n✔ critical path does not memoize a cycle-truncated dependency chain (1.020215ms)\\n✔ shows a blocked unit's decision even while other work is running (0.736806ms)\\n✔ keeps only the newest events and honours an explicit limit (1.109961ms)\\n✔ is read-only: building a view does not modify the operation (22.719515ms)\\n✔ renders units, decisions and the critical path deterministically (34.618306ms)\\n✔ truncates long titles when a width is given and leaves them alone otherwise (39.917212ms)\\n✔ a complete operation is terminal and has an empty critical path (1.312916ms)\\n✔ watch renders until the operation is terminal and never mutates it (55.626779ms)\\n✔ watch stops on abort, on a render limit and after repeated read failures (52.748896ms)\\n✔ the default sleep wakes promptly when the watch is aborted (46.156542ms)\\n✔ watch clears the screen only when asked (37.930237ms)\\n✔ status --dag prints the view and --dag --json prints the same facts without writing the operation (1751.144792ms)\\n✔ watch on a pipe renders one snapshot and exits non-zero while the operation is blocked (884.248905ms)\\n✔ watch on a pipe reports the operation's exit code for complete and cancelled (1736.984485ms)\\n✔ status and watch reject malformed or blank --events instead of guessing (4818.142508ms)\\n✔ watch's multiple-operation list sanitizes persisted…6216 tokens truncated…d fields and says so (1.012121ms)\\n  ✔ toolSubject picks the primary argument and redacts secrets (3.926708ms)\\n  ✔ toolSummary reports the first meaningful line and line count (1.759285ms)\\n  ✔ tool summaries and subjects drop terminal escape sequences (2.940266ms)\\n  ✔ projectTurn redacts every free-text field and leaves the rest intact (3.273339ms)\\n✔ protocol: projection helpers (14.153176ms)\\n▶ advertisements\\n  ✔ the gateway entry is read as a gateway advertisement with request counting (3.115071ms)\\n  ✔ vLLM-style max_model_len is capacity without request counting; a bare catalog advertises nothing (0.476687ms)\\n  ✔ a gateway reporting unknown capacity (null) is not a number (0.501093ms)\\n  ✔ changes in limits version, capacity, output allowance or serving workers are detected (0.593331ms)\\n✔ advertisements (7.121711ms)\\n▶ limits in effect\\n  ✔ advertised capacity wins over client defaults; an operator setting below it is kept, above it is capped (0.721767ms)\\n  ✔ standalone: operator configuration, else labelled client defaults; never unlimited (0.544592ms)\\n  ✔ the tool-output headroom is a policy value, separate from capacity and allowance (0.398034ms)\\n✔ limits in effect (2.317634ms)\\n▶ counts\\n  ✔ gateway 'exact' is exact for the sampled worker; 'estimated_conservative' is the gateway's estimate (0.74984ms)\\n  ✔ malformed answers are rejected, never guessed (0.351385ms)\