)\\n✔ a snapshotDir outside the checkpoint store is not deleted (14.354836ms)\\n✔ a symlinked snapshots root is not used as the confinement root (6.97…62 tokens truncated…tory is rejected by identity (4.543764ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint partition replaced after planning cannot redirect deletion (4.291434ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint partition replaced by another real directory is rejected by identity (4.327098ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint snapshots root replaced after planning preserves the record and external data (4.347983ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint snapshots root replaced by another real directory is rejected by identity (3.753155ms)\\n✔ a record cannot reclaim another checkpoint's snapshot (3.823996ms)\\n✔ a symlink inside snapshots that resolves outside is not followed for deletion (3.379789ms)\\n✔ the snapshots root itself is not treated as a checkpoint snapshot (3.572897ms)\\n✔ a record filename cannot normalize the expected snapshot path (8.132721ms)\\n✔ a snapshot path swapped after planning is not followed (4.009273ms)\\n✔ a snapshot inside the checkpoint store is still reclaimed (3.684616ms)\\n✔ configured hook guard forces event-wide disable after inherited enable (42.28836ms)\\n✔ configured hook guard fails closed on Git 2.54 (7.802925ms)\\n✔ checkpoint gc disables repository hooks and deletes the checkpoint ref (118.911093ms)\\n﹣ checkpoint gc disables configured hooks added immediately before ref deletion (83.455623ms) # event-wide repository hook suppression requires Git 2.55 or later\\n✔ checkpoint gc preserves a ref when its record changes after planning (80.049039ms)\\n✔ checkpoint gc restores the ref if the record changes during ref deletion (127.061783ms)\\n✔ checkpoint gc preserves the record and reports failure when ref deletion fails (112.673196ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793230443.1559358}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
