cution with complex workspace paths containing spaces and quotes\\n  ✔ Sandbox with workspace path containing spaces and quotes prints path via pwd (130.559758ms)\\n  ✔ Docker sandbox keeps shell syntax in workspace paths literal through the core bridge (76.085593ms)\\n✔ ACC-SAFE-05 & REQ-SEC-108: Sandbox execution with complex workspace paths containing spaces and quotes (209.394245ms)\\n[nexus] Web search: sending query to http://127.0.0.1:36025 (SearXNG) (default search provider; configure SEARXNG_URL for self-hosted search).\\n[nexus] Web search:…2911 tokens truncated… (origin: provider, HTTP 500): Inference error (HTTP 500): {\\\"error\\\":\\\"upstream rejected Bearer [REDACTED:BEARER_AUTH_HEADER]\\\"}\\n\\n  ✔ turn.result redacts secrets inside the embedded turn object (1885.775973ms)\\n[context_admission] step=1 request_id=59056db1-c187-4177-a95f-ee1c029fbcfb state=admitted estimated_tokens=4651 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=2\\n[token_count] step=1 request_id=59056db1-c187-4177-a95f-ee1c029fbcfb source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4651 client_estimate=4651 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\\\"the connection advertises no request counting\\\"\\n- Nexus is considering the next step\\n✖ Inference request aborted by operator\\n\\n! TURN INTERRUPTED  execution=INTERRUPTED outcome=NOT_ESTABLISHED; 0 tool call(s) not dispatched\\n\\n  ✔ an exception escaping runTurn is reported as INTERNAL and idle() still resolves (209.601186ms)\\n  ✔ a second prompt while busy is rejected with BUSY (1250.522956ms)\\n  ✔ malformed lines produce BAD_REQUEST errors (105.081814ms)\\n✔ SidecarServer: session and turns (7093.284117ms)\\n[provider_capabilities] reason=step model=m context 65536 (client_default); output allowance 8192 (client_default); discovery unsupported (catalog lists no limits); token counting unsupported\\n[context_admission] st