letion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=4\n[token_count] step=2 request_id=0f245768-c359-418f-89d5-edd0efb76c91 source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4736 client_estimate=4736 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n- Nexus is considering the next step\n✔ Nexus is considering the next step\n  · Writing file  f2.txt\n- Working: write_file\n✔ Working: write_file\n  change 5 lines  {\n    Full output retained in session evidence; use /tui and open this activity.\n\n[context_admission] step=3 request_id=25a37624-7baf-4d51-a3dc-db33a4e95086 state=admitted estimated_tokens=4815 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=6…2761 tokens truncated…request_id=d4b66d8d-698a-4685-9c2f-ab0a5eb184c9 state=admitted estimated_tokens=4651 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=2\n[token_count] step=1 request_id=d4b66d8d-698a-4685-9c2f-ab0a5eb184c9 source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4651 client_estimate=4651 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n- Nexus is considering the next step\n✖ Inference request aborted by operator\n\n! TURN INTERRUPTED  execution=INTERRUPTED outcome=NOT_ESTABLISHED; 0 tool call(s) not dispatched\n\n  ✔ steering pending at cancel is returned to the client (1083.377329ms)\n✔ steering through the sidecar (8301.329625ms)\n[provider_capabilities] reason=step model=m context 65536 (client_default); output allowance 8192 (client_default); discovery unsupported (catalog lists no limits); token counting unsupported\n[context_admission] step=1 request_id=31e81c47-82d1-4749-9c8b-3b19afd2969f state=admitted estimated_tokens=4655 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=2\n[token_count] step=1 request_id=31e81c47-82d1-4749-9c8b-3b19afd2969f source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4655 client_estimate=4655 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n- Nexus is considering the next step\n✔ Nexus is considering the next step\n  · Reading file  base.txt\n- Working: read_file\n✔ Working: read_file\n  done 7 lines  {\n    Full output retained in session evidence; use /tui and open this activity.\n\n[context_admission] step=2 request_id=38b71b89-9cd2-4d40-8649-6fd2211f047a state=admitted estimated_tokens=4906 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=5\n[token_count] step=2 request_id=38b71b89-9cd2-4d40-8649-6fd2211f047a source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4906 client_estimate=4906 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n- Nexus is considering the next step\n✔ Nexus is considering the next step\n\n💭 Assistant: done\n\n\n✓ TURN ENDED - NO CHANGES TO VERIFY  execution=COMPLETED outcome=NOT_REQUIRED modelStop=FINAL_TEXT\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793230583.4380918}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
