table. The existing renderer test also checks hostile SGR input without stripping it. The PTY wait now exceeds one second before sampling elapsed time; it still asserts that the timer appeared, so the wait does not mask a missing update.\\n\\nNo tests were run.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793230860.5396698}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
