{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:52:16.911Z","ordinal":469799,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a184ed-c30f-70d2-bb54-de446cff6c40","call_id":"call_45c8858269614b1983d0a71ac4d0e498","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 30.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"output\":\"✔ projects units, depth, durable state and the open decision (9.913484ms)\\n✔ reports resource eligibility with the scheduler's own rules (2.3491ms)\\n✔ shows a missing dependency and every unit on a cycle (2.33676ms)\\n✔ critical path does not memoize a cycle-truncated dependency chain (1.587545ms)\\n✔ shows a blocked unit's decision even while other work is running (1.333534ms)\\n✔ keeps only the newest events and honours an explicit limit (1.962778ms)\\n✔ is read-only: building a view does not modify the operation (22.680268ms)\\n✔ renders units, decisions and the critical path deterministically (30.939141ms)\\n✔ truncates long titles when a width is given and leaves them alone otherwise (48.591053ms)\\n✔ a complete operation is terminal and has an empty critical path (1.311218ms)\\n✔ watch renders until the operation is terminal and never mutates it (51.851ms)\\n✔ watch stops on abort, on a render limit and after repeated read failures (48.175693ms)\\n✔ the default sleep wakes promptly when the watch is aborted (43.407849ms)\\n✔ watch clears the screen only when asked (34.025631ms)\\n✔ status --dag prints the view and --dag --json prints the same facts without writing the operation (2213.560189ms)\\n✔ watch on a pipe renders one snapshot and exits non-zero while the operation is blocked (874.912132ms)\\n✔ watch on a pipe reports the operation's exit code for complete and cancelled (2164.245288ms)\\n✔ status and watch reject malformed or blank --events instead of guessing (5445.181667ms)\\n✔ watch's multiple-operation list sanitizes persisted objectives (952.550454ms)\\n✔ ordinary status sanitizes blocked decision identifiers (949.364899ms)\\n✔ rejected decisions sanitize the failing decision id (1147.895608ms)\\n✔ run sanitizes an operation id in its resume banner (871.34333ms)\\n✔ status and watch sanitize invalid operation identifiers and event arguments (2520.433955ms)\\n✔ run sanitizes resource and spec validation errors (1585.34102ms)\\n✔ terminal-safe rendering: operation text cannot emit control or escape sequences (14.166349ms)\\n✔ events are copied without their free-form detail (0.881367ms)\\n✔ the --json document satisfies the checked-in JSON schema (4.384365ms)\\n✔ a corrupt record is reported cleanly and quarantined by the shared loader (861.958887ms)\\n✔ projects the operation's git isolation and unit integration receipts (59.708889ms)\\n\",\"session_id\":99687}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184b8-1382-7c51-b7ba-1106ed9497c7","create_time":1793231536.9113612}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
