ex-root SUITE: focused serial validation of PR311 operation-view and active TUI PTY tests in isolated worktree.\n2026-10-28T23:42:27Z CLAIM V1_HELDOUT_CORPUS_CUSTODY_20261028 by=kimi-code user-assigned held-out corpus pickup; public metadata and authorized custody path first; no private payload exposure\n2026-10-28T23:43:58Z HANDOFF_REQUEST V1_HELDOUT_CORPUS_CUSTODY_20261028 by=kimi-code blocker=sealed_T2_and_T3_stores_root_root_0700_acl_no_access; authorized custodian must perform conversion/validation or provide an explicitly approved non-disclosing custody execution path; no sudo/content access attempted; current evaluator requires blackbox-v1 and legacy enabling is forbidden\n2026-10-28T23:44:33Z UPDATE V1_HELDOUT_CORPUS_CUSTODY_20261028 by=kimi-code REDACTED; T2_sha256=50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b legacy_incompatible; T3_sha256=85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383 historical_blackbox_v1_report_only; fresh_custody_acceptance=unverified; private_payload_access=none; qualification=unstarted; handoff=waiting_authorized_root_custodian\n2026-10-28T23:45:04Z CLAIM branch=v1/checkpoint-trail23-remediation REDACTED files=cli/src/checkpoint.ts,cli/test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts origin=cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e recovery=Entire_trail23_findings_supplied_by_user\n[2026-10-28T23:47:15Z] PR311 suite process 2610877 and child runner processes were confirmed absent after an observed live run; no terminal exit code/output was recoverable, so the full-suite attempt is recorded as inconclusive, not passing. SUITE claim remains with codex-root for subsequent focused verification. Independent-review finding addressed in the owned candidate worktree: disable expected CLI color with NO_COLOR, restore strict raw-control assertions, and add hostile SGR input with visible-escape expectation. No held-out material accessed.\n2026-10-28T23:53:36Z SUITE_RESULT branch=v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 classification=INCOMPLETE reason='all recorded test processes are terminal and exit output was not retained; no pass inferred' action=release_claim_for_next_validation owner=codex-root\n2026-10-28T23:54:08Z SUITE_CLAIM branch=v1/checkpoint-trail23-remediation snapshot=03bfaa39 suite=checkpoint_restore.test.ts\n[2026-10-29T00:02:00Z] SUITE released by codex-root after exact current candidate operation_view tests passed 29/29, process-scope fixtures passed, and diff check passed. No test runner remains active. Earlier full suite process did not yield a recoverable exit result and remains inconclusive. The 1.2s TUI PTY wait is unchanged from the combined focused run where that test passed. FILE claims remain active pending independent review.\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-28T23:04:04.534Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"PR311 exact-head CI failure remediation: correct ANSI-aware terminal safety assertions and elapsed-indicator PTY observation window\",\n  \"base\": \"4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb\",\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":739309734}},"started_at_ms":1793231713739,"completed_at_ms":1793231714478}}
