{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:59:38.960Z","ordinal":470097,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-1bac3d7f-7f37-445d-84e8-3214708aa275","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Entire status/Brain brief were checked. Entire search for PR311 history failed because token refresh could not access org.freedesktop.secrets. Per agent guide, continuing with exact live GitHub/working-tree evidence for this query., current_main_ci=Completed SUCCESS at 2026-10-28 ~23:13 UTC on exact main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e: Node22/24 matrices, Linux CLI suite, package/reproducibility pipeline all passed; CodeQL 40781709679 passed., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=At 2026-10-28 22:12Z, remote PR #310 head remains 1f54f2f7835e05b8470cb68156ec96362e99d8c7 on base 10c84df. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates in progress but neutral/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or public stable v1.0.0., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Repolled 2026-10-28 23:40 UTC: full CLI suite 2610877 remains live and advanced from team_convergence to test/tui_approval_input_e2e.test.ts. Candidate diff unchanged. Main CI/CodeQL remain green., review_policy=User confirmed single-user repository; do not require another human GitHub reviewer. Non-implementing independent agent review is the available independent source-review lane. Release acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS until mandatory exact-RC and external evidence passes., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=Completed. PR #310 merged 2026-10-28T22:39:59Z as cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e. Exact PR head 1f54f2f passed Node22/24, Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke, JS/TS, CodeQL; Entire Gates concluded NEUTRAL., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., rc_process=Verified from `.github/workflows/release.yml` and `scripts/sync-version.mjs` at exact current source 10c84df: root package.json is version source; sync-version updates CLI and Rust package/lock files. Tag workflow requires tag on main, tag/version match, and docs/releases/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Monitor exact PR311 checks. If all required checks pass and independent source review remains current, merge through the already granted authorization; then reconcile candidate branch claims, run exact-main post-merge CI/requirements, and begin successor-RC construction only after pre-RC prerequisites., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834 complete failure. Exact remediation files are claimed by an active codex-root owner in the same worktree; verified PID 2610877, same host/boot/cwd, focused npm test is live. Do not edit or run tests concurrently. PR CodeQL and JS/TS pass. Entire Gates failed but is not ruleset-required., terminal_screenshot_waiver=User explicitly waives screenshots as release artifacts on 2026-10-28. This does not waive live terminal matrix interactions, exact successor RC binding, dimensions, per-cell verdicts/observations, or safety gates., timestamp_followup=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed local branch codex/release-readiness-timestamp commit f56ece220613a86d79f22bcbdb1b234355a39a99 on cbb3b653; branch clean and one commit ahead; push withheld under owner-only boundary., current_main=origin/main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e after PR #310 merge. Exact clean-worktree requirements enforcement and version sync pass; current package metadata remains 1.0.0-rc.10. Post-merge CI run 40781709732 remains in progress., pr311_ci=Exact PR311 head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb failed Node22 and Node24, both with the same five operation-view tests treating expected ANSI SGR styling as unsafe controls and one TUI PTY elapsed timer race. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped after failed matrix. Fix draft is present in owned worktree but not yet committed or requalified., owner_action=No user action requested now. Held-out custody issue is awaiting custodian metadata response; no private material accessed. Manual 15-cell real-terminal qualification and installed-RC gates wait for a successor exact RC., pr311_auto_merge=Enabled 2026-10-28T22:51:06Z after confirming active ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, Linux; independent source review ACCEPT already recorded. Auto-merge is conditional; PR remains open until required exact-head checks pass., stale_claim_reconciliation=Archived own stale SEC_CODEQL_EVAL_TEST_SCRIPT_ARGS_20261026 claim as superseded, preserving branch/worktree and audit record. PR252 is merged, PR311 CodeQL passes, and GitHub code-scanning API returned zero open alerts., terminal_preflight=Verified by SSH on 2026-10-28: ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 has xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, VS Code 1.143.1; active local seat0 is Wayland. SSH DISPLAY is unset; no GUI windows were opened and no matrix cell was run. Result appended to nexus-claims.log; screenshot artifacts waived only., rc_tags=Current remote tags/releases refreshed 2026-10-28: latest published candidate is v1.0.0-rc.10 at tag commit 0e99eeb7268ec798d4859f01279c9db8b1ce42f6, peeled source 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0; no rc.11 or stable v1.0.0 exists. Candidate source version check remains rc.10., current_observation=2026-10-28 22:56 UTC: origin/main cbb3b653; PR311 head 4c4df05a auto-merge enabled, Node22/24 test matrices running, JS/TS and CodeQL pass; post-merge main CI Node24 pass, Node22 still running. Shared dirty checkout preserved., entire_pr311_gate=Exact PR311 head check Entire Gates failed with 3 reported items: no reviewer approved the trail, CI checks have not passed, and candidate is 8 commits behind. The protected branch ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 checks; Entire Gates is not required by the current ruleset. The source candidate has no changed-path overlap with the 8 current-main commits, but needs a current-base update and fresh exact-head qualification., source_divergence=PR311 merge-base is 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; current main cbb3b653 is 8 commits ahead and candidate 4c4df05a is 24 commits ahead. Changed paths across the two sides are disjoint. Defer merge/update until the active SUITE process finishes., draft_review=Independent reviewer /root/pr311_draft_review returned CHANGES_REQUIRED for diff SHA-256 78701fc73cc9d6d39bb504ff609dc0f8bcb703b31ed18099592b8c58846c1a24. The SGR-stripping helper can hide hostile raw SGR; add CLI hostile-SGR assertion requiring visible ESC representation and avoid blanket stripping. Reviewer accepted 1.2s PTY wait as retaining the strict elapsed threshold. No tests run by reviewer., heldout=Issue #1 remains OPEN and unassigned; latest custodian-facing metadata clarification is 2026-10-28T22:23:50Z. No custody response or private corpus access is verified., active_remediation=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC active codex-root owner claims SUITE and two CLI test files in PR311 candidate worktree; process PID 2610877 with Node test runner is still live at ~23:30, same host boot and cwd. Full CLI test command currently appears near the end of its test file list; no duplicate changes/tests started. Wait for completion, then inspect result and request handoff or reviewer outcome before action., heldout_custody=Issue #1 last comment remains owner-authored metadata request at 2026-10-28T22:23:50Z; no custodian response as of 23:08 UTC. No held-out payload accessed. Exact-RC held-out qualification cannot start until independent custody acceptance., updated 19 minutes ago\n  - [done] Resume checkpoint PR #308 fix and validate exact candidate (details=PR #308 merged 2026-10-28T21:15:37Z as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. Exact PR head 9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8 had Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL success; Entire Gates neutral. Main exact-head CI/CodeQL now running as 40770466028 / 40770465935.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [doing] Prepare manual terminal matrix on ubuntu-desktop (details=Fresh SSH at 2026-10-28 21:00 UTC to mike@10.0.8.3 succeeded. loginctl confirms active local session 7, seat0, Remote=no, Type=wayland. xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0 are present. No matrix cells executed: exact successor RC is not built/installed. Screenshots remain waived by user; interactive behavior checks remain required.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile RC10 provider lane (details=Read only committed origin/main evidence docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/openrouter-live-task/README.md and confirmed RC10 E5 OpenRouter small live task PASS on exact signed RC10 artifact (16ee8ca36438; published archive SHA-256 444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7). Synthetic JS slug task had 7 provider requests; declared verifier passed and independent validation passed added Unicode/emoji/whitespace assertions. README records earlier failed attempts separately and explicitly limits the pass to one small task. It points to RC10 provider verification receipts dated 2026-10-27; no redundant live inference run performed.), updated about 5 hours ago\n  - [done] Archive exact-RC10 ChatGPT provider verification (details=PR #309 exact head aace981bc3f46e10f1e57c5498825a76e9994ee5 independently ACCEPTed; five evidence checksums verified. Required Node22/24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL passed. Merged at 2026-10-28T20:36:21Z as b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af. Main CI run 40764779353 is in progress. RC10-only historical evidence.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Refresh readiness checkpoint and reconcile RC10 cross-runner evidence (details=Updated docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md in claimed PR #300 worktree at local commit 29ce2978d69554a50b52a0dba9783c986d2d61a1. Observation time 2026-10-28 20:52 UTC; exact main b3dea1a; main Node22/24 still in progress; PR308 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress; PR300 Node22/24 pass, Linux in progress. Independent review ACCEPT exact diff SHA-256 f2b2c2b9d4b28d69bcccba3f764f60ff99e2632a83cb303b2a944b6dce408705. `git diff --check` passed. No tests run for docs-only change; no push per repo owner boundary. PR branch requires reconcile with latest main and exact-head checks before integration.), updated about 3 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile exact requirements gate on current main (details=Verified on detached clean worktree at exact origin/main 13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0 using isolated HOME: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs -