{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:59:40.386Z","ordinal":470098,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a184f4-8762-7782-bbaf-10eddc8bca63","call_id":"call_33bb95298be0443f95bd5ab228804b7b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Entire status/Brain brief were checked. Entire search for PR311 history failed because token refresh could not access org.freedesktop.secrets. Per agent guide, continuing with exact live GitHub/working-tree evidence for this query., current_main_ci=Completed SUCCESS at 2026-10-28 ~23:13 UTC on exact main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e: Node22/24 matrices, Linux CLI suite, package/reproducibility pipeline all passed; CodeQL 40781709679 passed., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=At 2026-10-28 22:12Z, remote PR #310 head remains 1f54f2f7835e05b8470cb68156ec96362e99d8c7 on base 10c84df. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates in progress but neutral/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no accepted successor RC or public stable v1.0.0., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Repolled 2026-10-28 23:40 UTC: full CLI suite 2610877 remains live and advanced from team_convergence to test/tui_approval_input_e2e.test.ts. Candidate diff unchanged. Main CI/CodeQL remain green., review_policy=User confirmed single-user repository; do not require another human GitHub reviewer. Non-implementing independent agent review is the available independent source-review lane. Release acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS until mandatory exact-RC and external evidence passes., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=Completed. PR #310 merged 2026-10-28T22:39:59Z as cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e. Exact PR head 1f54f2f passed Node22/24, Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke, JS/TS, CodeQL; Entire Gates concluded NEUTRAL., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab