ce. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Monitor exact PR311 checks. If all required checks pass and independent source review remains current, merge through the already granted authorization; then reconcile candidate branch claims, run exact-main post-merge CI/requirements, and begin successor-RC construction only after pre-RC prerequisites., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834 complete failure. Exact remediation files are claimed by an active codex-root owner in the same worktree; verified PID 2610877, same host/boot/cwd, focused npm test is live. Do not edit or run tests concurrently. PR CodeQL and JS/TS pass. Entire Gates failed but is not ruleset-required., terminal_screenshot_waiver=User explicitly waives screenshots as release artifacts on 2026-10-28. This does not waive live terminal matrix interactions, exact successor RC binding, dimensions, per-cell verdicts/observations, or safety gates., timestamp_followup=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed local branch codex/release-readiness-timestamp commit f56ece220613a86d79f22bcbdb1b234355a39a99 on cbb3b653; branch clean and one commit ahead; push withheld under owner-only boundary., current_main=origin/main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e after PR #310 merge. Exact clean-worktree requirements enforcement and version sync pass; current package metadata remains 1.0.0-rc.10. Post-merge CI run 40781709732 remains in progress., pr311_ci=Exact PR311 head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb failed Node22 and Node24, both with the same five operation-view tests treating expected ANSI SGR styling as unsafe controls and one TUI PTY elapsed timer race. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped after failed matrix. Fix draft is present in owned worktree but not yet committed or requalified., owner_action=No user action requested now. Held-out custody issue is awaiting custodian metadata response; no private material accessed. Manual 15-cell real-terminal qualification and installed-RC gates wait for a successor exact RC., pr311_auto_merge=Enabled 2026-10-28T22:51:06Z after confirming active ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, Linux; independent source review ACCEPT already recorded. Auto-merge is conditional; PR remains open until required exact-head checks pass., stale_claim_reconciliation=Archived own stale SEC_CODEQL_EVAL_TEST_SCRIPT_ARGS_20261026 claim as superseded, preserving branch/worktree and audit record. PR252 is merged, PR311 CodeQL passes, and GitHub code-scanning API returned zero open alerts., terminal_preflight=Verified by SSH on 2026-10-28: ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 has xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, VS Code 1.143.1; active local seat0 is Wayland. SSH DISPLAY is unset; no GUI windows were opened and no matrix cell was run. Result appended to nexus-claims.log; screenshot artifacts waived only., rc_tags=Current remote tags/releases refreshed 2026-10-28: latest published candidate is v1.0.0-rc.10 at tag commit 0e99eeb7268ec798d4859f01279c9db8b1ce42f6, peeled source 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0; no rc.11 or stable v1.0.0 exists. Candidate source version check remains rc.10., current_observation=2026-10-28 22:56 UTC: origin/main cbb3b653; PR311 head 4c4df05a auto-merge enabled, Node22/24 test matrices running, JS/TS and CodeQL pass; post-merge main CI Node24 pass, Node22 still running. Shared dirty checkout preserved., entire_pr311_gate=Exact PR311 head check Entire Gates failed with 3 reported items: no reviewer approved the trail, CI checks have not passed, and candidate is 8 commits behind. The protected branch ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 checks; Entire Gates is not required by the current ruleset. The source candidate has no changed-path overlap with the 8 current-main commits, but needs a current-base update and fresh exact-head qualification., source_divergence=PR311 merge-base is 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; current main cbb3b653 is 8 commits ahead and candidate 4c4df05a is 24 commits ahead. Changed paths across the two sides are disjoint. Defer merge/update until the active SUITE process finishes., draft_review=Independent reviewer /root/pr311_draft_review returned CHANGES_REQUIRED for diff SHA-256 78701fc73cc9d6d39bb504ff609dc0f8bcb703b31ed18099592b8c58846c1a24. The SGR-stripping helper can hide hostile raw SGR; add CLI hostile-SGR assertion requiring visible ESC representation and avoid blanket stripping. Reviewer accepted 1.2s PTY wait as retaining the stric