{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:59:59.330Z","ordinal":470111,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a156fbe9-50e1-4b5f-9612-d987bb66821e","process_id":"3000","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 311 --json autoMergeRequest,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,title && gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/rulesets/25340146"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 311 --json autoMergeRequest,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,title && gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/rulesets/25340146"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"autoMergeRequest\":null,\"baseRefOid\":\"cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26/changes/nexus-code/26\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nIntegrates the independently reviewed, release-relevant source fixes accumulated on the current v1 convergence candidate. The 21-file change covers operation checkpoint/Git recovery, state and context restoration, provider/credential handling, evaluation-resource assertions, plan-only turn outcomes, and batch-read error propagation.\\n\\n## Exact revision\\n\\n- Original branch base: `main` at `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`\\n- Current PR base: `main` at `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e` (PR #310 merge; docs-only and file-disjoint)\\n- Head: `v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9` at `4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb`\\n- Diff: 24 commits; 21 files; 1,219 insertions and 151 deletions.\\n\\n## Review and validation\\n\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT for the 23-commit candidate at `b84c542de6a4c8de918bd6441b08c0bf1c0affd9`; follow-up batch-read fix ACCEPTed at exact commit `4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb` (patch SHA-256 `9becc0ae105bd658fd8ca73e57d3a18380f134babf37980d751984f4e3e7d9d9`). Reviewer did not run tests.\\n- Exact-head focused regression: `cargo test --locked --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml test_batch_read_line_collection_fails_on_mid_stream_error` passed 1/1 with isolated HOME.\\n- Exact-head `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 mapped to exact-RC qualification.\\n- Exact-head `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passed; synchronized version remains `1.0.0-rc.10`.\\n- The earlier full-suite result `1934/1937` was on prior head `b84c542`; it is incomplete historical evidence and is not claimed as a pass. This PR's exact-head CI is the required full-suite evidence.\\n- Prior package/reproducibility evidence is also from `b84c542`; it does not qualify this changed source or a successor RC and must be repeated against the final versioned candidate artifact.\\n\\n## Release status\\n\\nThis PR does not create or accept an RC. Held-out custody and qualification, provider/standalone, T3/T4, cross-runner reproducibility, and the 15-cell real-terminal matrix remain required. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"8e3bd15037f38517176b0ed057f95d73244dce8e\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(v1): converge reviewed source defects for RC qualification\"}\n{\"id\":25340146,\"name\":\"v1-protected-branches\",\"target\":\"branch\",\"source_type\":\"Repository\",\"source\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"enforcement\":\"active\",\"conditions\":{\"ref_name\":{\"exclude\":[],\"include\":[\"refs/heads/main\",\"refs/heads/v1/integration\"]}},\"rules\":[{\"type\":\"deletion\"},{\"type\":\"non_fast_forward\"},{\"type\":\"pull_request\",\"parameters\":{\"required_approving_review_count\":0,\"dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push\":false,\"required_reviewers\":[],\"require_code_owner_review\":false,\"require_last_push_approval\":false,\"required_review_thread_resolution\":false,\"require_extra_approval_for_unattributed_changes\":true,\"allowed_merge_methods\":[\"merge\"]}},{\"type\":\"required_status_checks\",\"parameters\":{\"strict_required_status_checks_policy\":false,\"do_not_enforce_on_create\":false,\"required_status_checks\":[{\"context\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"integration_id\":15368},{\"context\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"integration_id\":15368},{\"context\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"integration_id\":15368}]}}],\"node_id\":\"REDACTED\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-18T10:53:07.944Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-22T15:23:07.084Z\",\"bypass_actors\":[],\"current_user_can_bypass\":\"never\",\"_links\":{\"self\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/rulesets/25340146\"},\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/rules/25340146\"}}}","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":219745242}},"started_at_ms":1793231997110,"completed_at_ms":1793231999330}}
