{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:00:11.702Z","ordinal":470122,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28c8b0e3481a0a61b60d1d2628669","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The exact-head workflow is now running the Node 22 and Node 24 CLI suites; both have reached `npm test`. The PR description still names the old head and omits the accepted follow-up, so I’m correcting that record and enabling merge-after-required-checks for this reviewed candidate. The ruleset still requires Node 22, Node 24, and Linux."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793232011084,"completed_at_ms":1793232011702}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:00:11.706Z","ordinal":470123,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28c8b0e3481a0a61b60d1d2628669","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The exact-head workflow is now running the Node 22 and Node 24 CLI suites; both have reached `npm test`. The PR description still names the old head and omits the accepted follow-up, so I’m correcting that record and enabling merge-after-required-checks for this reviewed candidate. The ruleset still requires Node 22, Node 24, and Linux.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","create_time":1793232011.0582428,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28c8b0e3481a0a61b60d1d2628669","turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a184f5-01b9-70f1-8c42-e976fc117c30","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22348}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:00:15.736Z","ordinal":470124,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28c8bae9881a0b60e4d41c92e8b11","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ce55ea9bb9dc49bd821afb47cb040bee","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr311-body.md <<'EOF'\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26/changes/nexus-code/26\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nIntegrates the independently reviewed, release-relevant source fixes accumulated on the current v1 convergence candidate. The changes cover operation checkpoint/Git recovery, state and context restoration, provider/credential handling, evaluation-resource assertions, plan-only turn outcomes, and batch-read error propagation. The PR follow-up also fixes ANSI-aware terminal-control assertions and a PTY elapsed-timer sampling race.\\n\\n## Exact revision\\n\\n- Base: `main` at `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`\\n- Head: `v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9` at `8e3bd15037f38517176b0ed057f95d73244dce8e`\\n- The candidate branch includes the current main merge; no force update was used.\\n\\n## Review and validation\\n\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT for the batch-read fix and the exact two-file follow-up patch (SHA-256 `148ee8493d71a93f6fe679cee8677bca6fbd8a230721780b0ed2d7d2a62ed7c6`). The reviewer did not run tests.\\n- Local focused validation after `make build`: operation-view and active-TUI PTY test files passed 30/30.\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed on this clean exact candidate: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 mapped to exact-RC qualification.\\n- Exact-head GitHub CI is running. At the latest observation, Node 22 and Node 24 were running `npm --prefix cli test`; JS/TS and CodeQL passed. Linux is required and awaits the matrix jobs. Entire Gates is not a required branch-protection check.\\n- The earlier full local-suite attempt first lacked the generated `core/target/release/nexus-tui` prerequisite and exposed unrelated evaluator/terminal-environment failures. It is not claimed as a passing full suite; the exact-head GitHub CI remains authoritative for full-suite qualification.\\n\\n## Release status\\n\\nThis PR does not create or accept an RC. Held-out custody and qualification, provider/standalone, T3/T4, cross-runner reproducibility, and the live real-terminal matrix remain required. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated.\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 311 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr311-body.md && gh pr merge 311 --auto --merge\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":1200}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","create_time":1793232011.683531}}}
