{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:01:42.950Z","ordinal":470172,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184f2-b330-7982-9fc4-f56b7188c276","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28ce50fa081a091ce017be57e3ea7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I won’t require a second human reviewer. The non-implementing agent’s source review is accepted; independent acceptance of the exact RC is still required.\n\nPR #311 is updated to base `cbb3b653` and head `8e3bd150`. Auto-merge is enabled, gated on the protected checks. CodeQL and JS/TS have passed; Node 22 and Node 24 are still running the full CLI suite. Linux remains required after those jobs finish. The [PR](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/311) is not merged yet.\n\nThe requirements gate passes on the clean candidate, with 12 requirements still assigned to exact-RC qualification. Kimi’s custody lane remains unable to access the private corpus store; held-out qualification has not started. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793232101098,"completed_at_ms":1793232102949}}
