{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:09:06.285Z","ordinal":470354,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28ea1403c81a09c458590d1e7fb5a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Got it: the custodian will perform the corpus validation. The needed result is a metadata-only custody acceptance for the sealed corpus: fresh blackbox-v1 validation, re-derived private digests, independent-author/exposure confirmation, setup/reference checks, and effective access-boundary confirmation. No payloads or answers need to be shared with implementation agents. I’m continuing to monitor PR #311."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793232545614,"completed_at_ms":1793232546285}}
