{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:09:42.810Z","ordinal":470385,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28ec5688881a099b83d06e79a7aef","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4c757aa002124249ae5f1484e00d4ada","name":"exec","input":"const results = await Promise.allSettled([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh pr view 311 --json number,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,autoMergeRequest,statusCheckRollup,url\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:2500}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh run view 40790448043 --json status,conclusion,headSha,jobs,url\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3500}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh issue view 1 --json state,assignees,updatedAt,comments,url\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3500}),\n  tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read({list:\"v1.0.0 release\",includeClosed:false})\n]);\nfor (const r of results) text(JSON.stringify(r));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","create_time":1793232581.410987}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:09:42.886Z","ordinal":470386,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ae28ec3baa881a082eee47ada0122f8","usage":{"input_tokens":80875,"cached_input_tokens":79744,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":304,"reasoning_output_tokens":52,"total_tokens":81179},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1763167,"cached_input_tokens":1689984,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4506,"reasoning_output_tokens":1150,"total_tokens":1767673},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":8700873693,"cached_input_tokens":8608179072,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":24717660,"reasoning_output_tokens":14241531,"total_tokens":8725591353}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:09:42.891Z","ordinal":470387,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-33491611-6866-4ebb-9c74-a56f23b22533","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.0.0 release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Entire status/Brain brief were checked. Entire search for PR311 history failed because token refresh could not access org.freedesktop.secrets. Per agent guide, continuing with exact live GitHub/working-tree evidence for this query., current_main_ci=Completed SUCCESS at 2026-10-28 ~23:13 UTC on exact main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e: Node22/24 matrices, Linux CLI suite, package/reproducibility pipeline all passed; CodeQL 40781709679 passed., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=At 2026-10-28 22:12Z, remote PR #310 head remains 1f54f2f7835e05b8470cb68156ec96362e99d8c7 on base 10c84df. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates in progress but neutral/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; campaign ACTIVE; exact-RC/manual/custody qualification incomplete., ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Repolled 2026-10-28 23:40 UTC: full CLI suite 2610877 remains live and advanced from team_convergence to test/tui_approval_input_e2e.test.ts. Candidate diff unchanged. Main CI/CodeQL remain green., review_policy=User confirmed single-user repository; do not require another human GitHub account. Non-implementing agent review is the independent source-review path. This does not replace independent exact-RC acceptance., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=Completed. PR #310 merged 2026-10-28T22:39:59Z as cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e. Exact PR head 1f54f2f passed Node22/24, Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke, JS/TS, CodeQL; Entire Gates concluded NEUTRAL., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., rc_process=Verified from `.github/workflows/release.yml` and `scripts/sync-version.mjs` at exact current source 10c84df: root package.json is version source; sync-version updates CLI and Rust package/lock files. Tag workflow requires tag on main, tag/version match, and docs/releases/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Continue monitoring the exact PR311 head checks. On successful required checks, verify auto-merge created the integration commit, then run exact-main CI/requirements and proceed to RC prerequisites. In parallel, held-out qualification remains stopped until Kimi/custodian resolves legacy-validator compatibility and restricted-store handoff. No stable RC or release acceptance., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834 complete failure. Exact remediation files are claimed by an active codex-root owner in the same worktree; verified PID 2610877, same host/boot/cwd, focused npm test is live. Do not edit or run tests concurrently. PR CodeQL and JS/TS pass. Entire Gates failed but is not ruleset-required., terminal_screenshot_waiver=User explicitly waives screenshots as release artifacts on 2026-10-28. This does not waive live terminal matrix interactions, exact successor RC binding, dimensions, per-cell verdicts/observations, or safety gates., timestamp_followup=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed local branch codex/release-readiness-timestamp commit f56ece220613a86d79f22bcbdb1b234355a39a99 on cbb3b653; branch clean and one commit ahead; push withheld under owner-only boundary., current_main=origin/main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e after PR #310 merge. Exact clean-worktree requirements enforcement and version sync pass; current package metadata remains 1.0.0-rc.10. Post-merge CI run 40781709732 remains in progress., pr311_ci=Exact PR311 head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb failed Node22 and Node24, both with the same five operation-view tests treating expected ANSI SGR styling as unsafe controls and one TUI PTY elapsed timer race. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped after failed matrix. Fix draft is present in owned worktree but not yet committed or requalified., owner_action=No user action requested now. Held-out custody issue is awaiting custodian metadata response; no private material accessed. Manual 15-cell real-terminal qualification and installed-RC gates wait for a successor exact RC., pr311_auto_merge=Enabled 2026-10-28T22:51:06Z after confirming active ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, Linux; independent source review ACCEPT already recorded. Auto-merge is conditional; PR remains open until required exact-head checks pass., stale_claim_reconciliation=Archived own stale SEC_CODEQL_EVAL_TEST_SCRIPT_ARGS_20261026 claim as superseded, preserving branch/worktree and audit record. PR252 is merged, PR311 CodeQL passes, and GitHub code-scanning API returned zero open alerts., terminal_preflight=Verified by SSH on 2026-10-28: ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 has xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, VS Code 1.143.1; active local seat0 is Wayland. SSH DISPLAY is unset; no GUI windows were opened and no matrix cell was run. Result appended to nexus-claims.log; screenshot artifacts waived only., rc_tags=Current remote tags/releases refreshed 2026-10-28: latest published candidate is v1.0.0-rc.10 at tag commit 0e99eeb7268ec798d4859f01279c9db8b1ce42f6, peeled source 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0; no rc.11 or stable v1.0.0 exists. Candidate source version check remains rc.10., current_observation=2026-10-28 22:56 UTC: origin/main cbb3b653; PR311 head 4c4df05a auto-merge enabled, Node22/24 test matrices running, JS/TS and CodeQL pass; post-merge main CI Node24 pass, Node22 still running. Shared dirty checkout preserved., entire_pr311_gate=Exact PR311 head check Entire Gates failed with 3 reported items: no reviewer approved the trail, CI checks have not passed, and candidate is 8 commits behind. The protected branch ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 checks; Entire Gates is not required by the current ruleset. The source candidate has no changed-path overlap with the 8 current-main commits, but needs a current-base update and fresh exact-head qualification., source_divergence=PR311 merge-base is 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; current main cbb3b653 is 8 commits ahead and candidate 4c4df05a is 24 commits ahead. Changed paths across the two sides are disjoint. Defer merge/update until the active SUITE process finishes., draft_review=Independent reviewer /root/pr311_draft_review returned CHANGES_REQUIRED for diff SHA-256 78701fc73cc9d6d39bb504ff609dc0f8bcb703b31ed18099592b8c58846c1a24. The SGR-stripping helper can hide host