{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T00:10:02.321Z","ordinal":470404,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a184fe-04d1-7e33-a3d5-5a10562f08e3","call_id":"call_9eef2ecf6f40447eb777c55cd6d97367","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nAcknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\n\nBehavior\n--------\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\n- Safe to call multiple times;\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\n\nexec to\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nCreate a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\n\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\n--------------------------------------\n- Always creates a new identit\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\n- As a guard be\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMark a window identity as expired.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nwindow_uuid : str\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\n\nReturns\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\n\nFilters\n-------\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nsince_hours : float\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this win\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nFetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\ntopic_name : str\n    The topic \nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\n\nSemantics\n---------\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation exists \nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nForce-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\n\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyond thres\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-disk archi\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestio\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nReturn basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check(args: { format?: string | nu\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\n\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; }\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList active window identities for a project.\n\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproje\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_hand\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nReserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservat\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMacro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndecl\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMark a specific message as read for the given agent.\n\nNotes\n-----\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\n- This does not send an acknowledgeme\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nDelete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\n- To upda\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRelease active file reservations held by an agent.\n\nBehavior\n--------\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are release\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nUpdate the display name of a window identity.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nwindow_uuid : str\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\nn\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nExtend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project slug or human key.\nagent_name : str\n    \nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nReply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\n\nBehavior\n--------\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\n- `thread_id` is taken from the o\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\n\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover ava\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nApprove or deny a contact request.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact(args: { accept: boolean; format?: string | null; fro\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSoft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visible in 'a\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\n\nTips\n----\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\"build plan\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\n- Results are or\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: re\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSet contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy(args: { ag\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSummarize all recent project messages within a time window.\n\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\nthread, and produces a combined project-wide su\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nExtract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\n\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\n- Returns detailed summary with optional example mess\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRestore an archived project back to active status.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project(args: { project_key: string; regis\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\n\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallTool\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRestore a retired agent back to active status. The agent will resume accepting new messages.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_a\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nReturn enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{projec"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a184fb-edd7-75b1-83a2-b880cb0cb65a","create_time":1793232602.321359}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
